            <folder name="[CT3] Governed Activity Execution Control" id="id-845f1e79934b45a6bb47bdcb0dd389e8">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Governed Activity Execution Control" id="id-dfb644fa99745553bf0ff980faf30c6d">
                <documentation>Instantiate, dispatch, supervise and progress authorised operational undertakings with explicit outcome standing.

**Overview**

Reusable execution control respects work-unit archetype, participation and uncertain effects rather than equating dispatch with completion.

**Intent**

Progress accountable operational work without equating dispatch, execution and successful outcome.

**Boundary**

Does not own underlying clinical-work meaning, clinical decisions or originator business authority.</documentation>
