            <folder name="[CT3] Authoritative Durable State Establishment" id="id-fdc4ac4686054ace8456b4c7b09e99f4">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Authoritative Durable State Establishment" id="id-591ee54ab6145bf58e837667f64a4265">
                <documentation>Atomically establish durable managed state and its authoritative version progression.

**Overview**

Durable acceptance gives managed information an explicit committed state from which applicable active representations can be reconstructed.

**Intent**

Give managed change an explicit committed state and authoritative progression basis.

**Boundary**

Commit is distinct from semantic source authority and from successful active convergence; applications do not gain a raw persistence path.</documentation>
