          <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Governed Information Operations" id="id-a0eebbba1ce35b2ea9bf499d3ea6b4c2">
            <documentation>Maintain identifiable, meaningful, context-qualified and retrievable information through valid state progression.

**Overview**

Entity integrity, context, lifecycle, information maintenance, discovery and semantic conformance are constituent reusable abilities; none is an implementation subsystem.

**Intent**

Keep information identity, meaning, context, state and retrieval compatible across diverse healthcare uses.

**Boundary**

Information management and semantic governance do not grant originating domain authority or erase active/durable state separation.</documentation>
