          <folder name="[CT2] Policy &amp; Control" id="id-361ec72ee7c1495cbe7c601fa70e7e08">
            <folder name="[CT3] Operation Policy Resolution" id="id-bb043fb359b84909a7a28e71785cfaeb">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Operation Policy Resolution" id="id-0331dca5104b504794a216037ed9bd40">
                <documentation>Resolve effective, temporally applicable permission criteria for an established identity and governed operation.

**Overview**

Permission depends on controlled criteria, role assignments, action and information scope; revocation is distinct from natural expiry.

**Intent**

Determine the effective permitted action under the applicable identity, information and temporal criteria.

**Boundary**

Does not authenticate identity or grant permission from caller-controlled tags or mere role names.</documentation>
