          <folder name="[CT2] Provenance &amp; Traceability" id="id-23f32f89a0d948fba33f06abc31c21ed">
            <folder name="[CT3] Governed Activity Audit Evidence" id="id-5dbf8992da4445f0835f74e2fb5e581b">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Governed Activity Audit Evidence" id="id-606f9b0a3e6a51b5a9f6be7518853d78">
                <documentation>Capture required significant activity and decision evidence under its applicable governed capture authority.

**Overview**

Denied actions and successful mutations may both require trustworthy evidence; the audited identity and capture authority remain distinct.

**Intent**

Preserve required significant action evidence under its proper capture authority.

**Boundary**

Mandatory capture authority is specific to the established audit responsibility, not a platform-wide permission shortcut.</documentation>
