            <folder name="[CT3] Information Attribution &amp; Lineage" id="id-e9939f79e1004b9ba4755755d288025c">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Information Attribution &amp; Lineage" id="id-08b52c79a6275638bdaa2e33d701aaea">
                <documentation>Preserve source attribution and significant transformation relationships for managed information.

**Overview**

Lineage explains how an assertion reached its present form without turning every infrastructure event into provenance.

**Intent**

Explain the information-significant origin and transformation of an assertion.

**Boundary**

Does not infer clinical credibility from a successful transport or establish independent assurance findings.</documentation>
