            <folder name="[CT3] Care Intake Management" id="id-88bda65536d74810aa5c36ceb7cafdf9">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Care Intake Management" id="id-2c9e89d0cee75ce3a1a2e6ff62449a74">
                <documentation>Establish and manage the intake context through which an individual seeks or enters care.

Care Intake Management establishes the access context through which a person seeks or enters care. It makes the entry circumstance manageable without assuming that every intake follows a referral or already satisfies eligibility conditions. Within Care Access Management, intake is the responsibility for entry context rather than a decision that all subsequent care arrangements are complete.

**Boundary**

An intake record does not establish acceptance of a referral, care responsibility or delivery of care.</documentation>
