          <folder name="[CT2] Care Coordination &amp; Transition" id="id-62be2104bd45461fbcce35317acf9d0e">
            <folder name="[CT3] Care Discharge Coordination" id="id-11a415a823494d7cb070894acd890c1e">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Care Discharge Coordination" id="id-e4d13d2f89595e61a5190d63673c8051">
                <documentation>Coordinate applicable discharge requirements and progression.

Care Discharge Coordination brings applicable discharge requirements and progression into a coherent operational context. It supports the transition out of a care circumstance while keeping readiness, physical exit and continuing responsibility distinguishable. The capability concerns coordinating those requirements rather than deciding that every clinical condition for discharge has been met.

**Boundary**

Discharge readiness and departure are not themselves evidence that another participant has accepted care responsibility.</documentation>
