            <folder name="[CT3] Care-Place Readiness Management" id="id-1218bbd35bdb45b88ad56936e7d15ba7">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Care-Place Readiness Management" id="id-040505098b205e8db531a93757549c7d">
                <documentation>Establish and manage whether a particular care place is ready for allocation or use.

Care-Place Readiness Management establishes whether a particular place can be allocated or used in its operational context. It connects the place's condition with its intended use so that vacancy can be distinguished from readiness. This is a place-specific responsibility within scheduling and capacity, supporting credible allocation rather than merely counting physical spaces.

**Boundary**

Readiness of one place does not establish collective readiness or usable capacity of the whole service.</documentation>
