          <folder name="[CT2] Care Support Logistics Management" id="id-3ddcf2dce54540d2b2c03ba2241e80c8">
            <folder name="[CT3] Care Support Work Coordination" id="id-6d92331e5ebb4de7819203454b41db09">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Care Support Work Coordination" id="id-a895e887fe115faa9c303cf60916173a">
                <documentation>Coordinate authorised operational support work: what needs doing, who performs it and how progression, completion or escalation is coordinated.

Care Support Work Coordination organises authorised operational support work around care: what needs doing, who will perform it and how progress, completion or escalation is coordinated. It gives supporting activity an explicit progression responsibility, rather than assuming that issuing a request means the work occurred. The work remains bounded by applicable authority and resource constraints.

**Boundary**

Dispatch does not establish worker availability, qualification or privilege, and support coordination does not determine clinical work.</documentation>
