            <folder name="[CT3] Clinical Material Logistics Coordination" id="id-e462dbf962444587927f1a85e24cd055">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Material Logistics Coordination" id="id-5498ead3fc4852cb8d4e12c5010f3e9e">
                <documentation>Coordinate clinically relevant material movement, custody, availability or disposition needed for care or diagnostic fulfilment.

This capability coordinates clinically relevant material movement and the custody, availability or disposition needed for care or diagnostic fulfilment. It makes the material's operational journey intelligible while retaining why the material matters to the clinical activity. The responsibility differs from moving a patient and from managing the diagnostic meaning of information derived from a specimen.

**Boundary**

Bounded clinical-material logistics does not establish a general procurement, supply-chain or enterprise inventory architecture.</documentation>
