 from its applicable dependencies.&quot;,&quot;proposal_overview&quot;:&quot;Collective readiness is an access prerequisite and has a coherent proposed preparedness frame; it is not reduced to capacity, resource state or service alignment.&quot;,&quot;record_state&quot;:&quot;current&quot;,&quot;reference_id&quot;:&quot;HCM-BC-health-service-operational-readiness&quot;,&quot;responsibility_owner_key&quot;:null,&quot;source_rad_documents&quot;:[&quot;docs/markdown/02-strategy/capabilities/business-capabilities.md&quot;],&quot;sources&quot;:[{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;oi-bc-002--health-service-operational-readiness-placement&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:1201,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Its provisional name/identified identity and boundary are retained, but **CT2 parent,&quot;}],&quot;structural_id_status&quot;:&quot;Proposed&quot;,&quot;tier&quot;:&quot;CT3&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;capability&quot;,&quot;unresolved&quot;:[&quot;identified_readiness_placement&quot;],&quot;views&quot;:[]}"/>
