            <folder name="[CT3] Clinical Quality Review &amp; Assessment Management" id="id-47117f4b4814492cab4811b8c9e565c2">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Quality Review &amp; Assessment Management" id="id-0d3beb2699a45eb081120d317f4a9a33">
                <documentation>Review evidence against applicable criteria and establish a clinical-quality assessment, finding or conclusion.

This capability evaluates quality evidence against applicable criteria and establishes a finding, assessment or conclusion. It is the judgement-bearing responsibility within Clinical Quality Management, distinct from maintaining the material and from communicating the result. Making that distinction supports scrutiny of the criterion and evidentiary basis for a quality assessment.

**Boundary**

An assessment is not a report of itself or the subsequent improvement action it may inform.</documentation>
