            <folder name="[CT3] Clinical Risk Mitigation Management" id="id-5c243410ac6648abb171216c80184c65">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Risk Mitigation Management" id="id-e85728e190e25bb488c845e6e92016a4">
                <documentation>Manage prospective/preventative measures reducing identified risk likelihood, exposure or consequence.

Clinical Risk Mitigation Management addresses prospective measures intended to reduce an identified risk's likelihood, exposure or consequences. It gives prevention a distinct responsibility alongside risk characterisation and active response. Required measures can involve other capabilities without transferring the ownership of their actions or information to safety management.

**Boundary**

Mitigation differs from containing or remediating a concern that has materialised or requires active intervention.</documentation>
