 safety concerns; adverse event and incident management, reporting and response; infection control; operational quality and safety monitoring; continuous quality improvement; and coordination of operational responses to identified concerns.\n\n&quot;,&quot;id_aliases&quot;:[],&quot;key&quot;:&quot;capability:clinical-quality-safety--improvement&quot;,&quot;latex_label&quot;:&quot;cap:bc-clinical-quality-safety-improvement&quot;,&quot;local_id&quot;:&quot;CLINICAL-QUALITY-SAFETY-IMPROVEMENT&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Clinical Quality, Safety &amp; Improvement&quot;,&quot;name_aliases&quot;:[],&quot;name_status&quot;:&quot;Canonical&quot;,&quot;owner_identifier&quot;:null,&quot;owner_key&quot;:null,&quot;parent_identifier&quot;:null,&quot;parent_key&quot;:null,&quot;placement_status&quot;:&quot;Established&quot;,&quot;record_state&quot;:&quot;current&quot;,&quot;reference_id&quot;:&quot;HCM-BC-clinical-quality-safety-improvement&quot;,&quot;relevance&quot;:&quot;Harmonia-Relevant&quot;,&quot;responsibility_owner_key&quot;:null,&quot;source_rad_documents&quot;:[&quot;docs/markdown/02-strategy/capabilities/business-capabilities.md&quot;],&quot;sources&quot;:[{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;06-clinical-quality-safety--improvement&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:522,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;#### 06. Clinical Quality, Safety &amp; Improvement&quot;},{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;06-clinical-quality-safety--improvement&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:526,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;**Definition:** Operational clinical quality, safety and improvement: monitoring clinical outcomes; identifying quality and safety concerns; adverse event and incident management, reporting and response; infection control; operational quality and safety monitoring; continuous quality improvement; and coordination of operational responses to identified concerns.&quot;},{&quot;anchor&quot;:null,&quot;line&quot;:120,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;catalogue domains below are explicitly **CT1 roots**; each branch statement&quot;}],&quot;structural_id_status&quot;:&quot;Established&quot;,&quot;tier&quot;:&quot;CT1&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;capability&quot;,&quot;unresolved&quot;:[],&quot;views&quot;:[&quot;region:care--health-delivery&quot;]}"/>
