            <folder name="[CT3] Preventative Health Programme Monitoring" id="id-ff94970f59b3457aa8db75617f062898">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Preventative Health Programme Monitoring" id="id-2353057b450154eda7dddfb4ea6b088f">
                <documentation>Observe programme operation, reach, participation, coverage, progress and applicable performance.

This capability observes how a preventative programme is operating, including reach, participation, coverage and progress. It supplies an account of programme performance in the programme's own scope, rather than substituting population-health state for evidence of programme activity. That account can inform reporting or consideration of the programme without itself being an assurance conclusion.

**Boundary**

Programme monitoring is distinct from individual health monitoring, population assessment and independent assurance.</documentation>
