            <folder name="[CT3] Operational Oversight" id="id-a834dd9f1c3c4b96b30ad1e40371b6b1">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Operational Oversight" id="id-ac9ffa1aed395f0b8127666f1cec22a1">
                <documentation>Observe broader operational conditions affecting the organisation’s ability to work or deliver services.

Operational Oversight observes broader operating conditions affecting the organisation's ability to work and deliver services. It provides context beyond an individual work item or care place, helping make material constraints visible. Within corporate support it remains a broad enterprise responsibility rather than an inferred owner for every operational-readiness question.

**Boundary**

Oversight does not resolve collective service-readiness placement or constitute independent assurance merely through observation.</documentation>
