            <folder name="[CT3] People Management" id="id-48ca6f8c356b4a05b832c8aa235a894d">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="People Management" id="id-6b1554d6db2b5de4ad5ba2d0c8ca2852">
                <documentation>Manage people across the organisation, distinct from practitioner-specific Health Workforce Management.

People Management addresses people across the organisation as an enterprise support responsibility. It retains a scope broader than the practitioner-specific standing, privilege and coverage concerns of Health Workforce Management. This distinction allows health-service activity to consume relevant people context without redefining all workforce administration as clinical governance.

**Boundary**

General people administration does not itself establish practitioner clinical qualification or privilege.</documentation>
