          <folder name="[CT2] Financial &amp; Commercial Services" id="id-0c4a9cf4698a4b22b8bb7d149a7d375b">
            <folder name="[CT3] Clinical Activity Charging Information Provision" id="id-afec173e76044931aa37c09757f918f6">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Activity Charging Information Provision" id="id-634d1636ba465070bd42fa4ae01abfb1">
                <documentation>Identify and provide information about chargeable or cost-relevant clinical/health-service activity where required for applicable funding, financial or charging purposes.

This capability identifies and supplies information about clinical or health-service activity relevant to legitimate charging, funding or cost purposes. Requests, service types, quantities and utilisation context may contribute evidence, but chargeability cannot be inferred from the fact that Harmonia mediated an interaction. Its outcome is usable activity information for the responsible financial context.

**Boundary**

Evidence provision does not perform pricing, billing, claims, accounting or revenue management.</documentation>
