            <folder name="[CT3] Diagnostic Report Distribution" id="id-42a66fc2bd9c48dea53dd65b1b7e38ce">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Diagnostic Report Distribution" id="id-d5b1d7f0358b5ce095b5a56df9c07714">
                <documentation>Provide an established report to applicable authorised recipients or consuming contexts under applicable access, privacy, security and communication controls.

Diagnostic Report Distribution provides an already established report to applicable authorised recipients or consuming contexts. Its purpose is to make the governed findings available where they are needed, while respecting access, privacy, security and communication controls. Distribution retains the report's standing rather than originating or silently reinterpreting its findings.

**Boundary**

Delivery does not establish clinical review, report authorisation or a patient-level clinical decision.</documentation>
