            <folder name="[CT3] Diagnostic Service Appointment Management" id="id-da7e72343bb64d8eac7db4b2329583aa">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Diagnostic Service Appointment Management" id="id-7696a9fe8110555a86684f99345ad30f">
                <documentation>Manage the diagnostic-service-specific scheduled opportunity, including preparation, modality, urgency, duration and other service-specific constraints.

Diagnostic Service Appointment Management makes a scheduled diagnostic opportunity credible in the service's own context. Preparation, modality, urgency and duration can materially affect whether an appointment is usable, so the responsibility is richer than recording a generic time slot. It supports service access while remaining separate from performance of the diagnostic activity.

**Boundary**

A diagnostic booking establishes neither evidence acquisition nor a report and is distinct from generic Care Appointment Management.</documentation>
