            <folder name="[CT3] Diagnostic Service Delivery" id="id-f9a4d3ef080d4c06b18954caa84fbb15">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Diagnostic Service Delivery" id="id-d798c8f902f45a40a16f1f6c5c50d79e">
                <documentation>Perform the diagnostic activity that obtains or produces diagnostic evidence.

Diagnostic Service Delivery performs the activity that obtains or produces diagnostic evidence. Within Diagnostic Support Provision it is the point at which the diagnostic procedure actually occurs, rather than being scheduled or requested. The evidence obtained can then be managed and interpreted under the distinct responsibilities that give it professional meaning.

**Boundary**

Performance does not itself establish interpretation, report authorisation or report delivery.</documentation>
