          <folder name="[CT2] Medication &amp; Pharmacy Services" id="id-a7efa456a32e4a6b830889b60c11163e">
            <folder name="[CT3] Medication Advice" id="id-3aa1f273946a4a6b8f8c74954c4843ed">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Medication Advice" id="id-e6f04439399a50f395bc63f6d32a4a20">
                <documentation>Provide professional medication-specific advice about appropriate use, precautions, interactions, administration, adherence or safe handling.

Medication Advice provides professional guidance about medication use and its precautions, interactions, administration, adherence or handling. It supports understanding of how medication can be used safely without turning every advisory interaction into a prescribing decision. Within pharmacy services, the advice outcome is distinct from provision of the medicine itself.

**Boundary**

Advice does not confer authority to diagnose, prescribe or alter treatment; detailed scope remains subject to refinement.</documentation>
