                <property key="v0.2 / Source Locators" value="[{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;ct2--medication--pharmacy-services&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:489,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;| Medication Advice | Provide professional medication-specific advice about appropriate use, precautions, interactions, administration, adherence or safe handling. |&quot;},{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;ct2--medication--pharmacy-services&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:483,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;**Decomposition assertion:** Each named child in this table is a CT3 Business Capability whose immediate CT2 parent is Medication &amp; Pharmacy Services; that CT2 has the CT1 parent stated above.&quot;},{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;ct2--medication--pharmacy-services&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:492,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;**Boundary:** Medication prescribed ≠ dispensed ≠ provided ≠ administered. Advice does not establish diagnosis, prescribing or authority to alter treatment. Dose aid provision does not establish the regimen; commercial packaging examples do not define the capability. These are pharmacy responsibilities, distinct from clinical intervention, and do not prescribe a medication sequence. Medication Advice’s detailed scope remains subject to refinement. OI-BC-001 remains unresolved; compounding/preparation is neither established, rejected nor silently subsumed.&quot;}]"/>
