acy responsibilities, distinct from clinical intervention, and do not prescribe a medication sequence. Medication Advice’s detailed scope remains subject to refinement. OI-BC-001 remains unresolved; compounding/preparation is neither established, rejected nor silently subsumed.&quot;},{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;oi-bc-001--medication-compounding-and-preparation&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:1184,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;### OI-BC-001 — Medication Compounding and Preparation&quot;}],&quot;structural_id_status&quot;:&quot;Established&quot;,&quot;tier&quot;:&quot;CT2&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;capability&quot;,&quot;unresolved&quot;:[&quot;relevance&quot;,&quot;medication_compounding&quot;],&quot;views&quot;:[&quot;region:care--health-delivery&quot;]}"/>
