nce/authority remain distinguishable; no mandatory knowledge workflow is prescribed.&quot;}],&quot;structural_id_status&quot;:&quot;Established&quot;,&quot;tier&quot;:&quot;CT3&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;capability&quot;,&quot;unresolved&quot;:[&quot;relevance&quot;],&quot;views&quot;:[&quot;region:health-information--digital-health&quot;]}"/>
