            <folder name="[CT3] Clinical Knowledge Context Identification" id="id-d8680f3df44147d482f66ec72b826918">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Knowledge Context Identification" id="id-7b82f2cc17bc5a69a36a16fc585f9159">
                <documentation>Identify sources/contexts potentially containing reusable clinical knowledge.

This capability identifies sources or contexts that may contain reusable clinical knowledge. It establishes where potentially useful material can be sought without assuming that all source information is already formulated knowledge. Within knowledge management it provides a contextual starting point rather than an approval or publication outcome.

**Boundary**

Identifying a source does not extract its material, establish reusable knowledge or determine its clinical applicability.</documentation>
