            <folder name="[CT3] Clinical Knowledge Publication &amp; Sharing" id="id-84be19452caf44df977e9160319f2a00">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Knowledge Publication &amp; Sharing" id="id-8cd4e38728b558789c67536ab75f508e">
                <documentation>Make approved knowledge available to applicable authorised consumers and use contexts.

Clinical Knowledge Publication &amp; Sharing makes approved knowledge available to applicable authorised consumers and contexts. It preserves the standing and limits under which knowledge was approved rather than reducing publication to unrestricted dissemination. Its contribution is availability for appropriate use, distinct from both approval and the individual clinical application that may follow.

**Boundary**

Published knowledge is not a patient-specific conclusion, decision or instruction merely because a clinician can access it.</documentation>
                <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="business-capability:clinical-knowledge-publication--sharing"/>
                <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="HCM-BC-clinical-knowledge-publication-sharing"/>
