            <folder name="[CT3] Assurance Evidence Assessment" id="id-487e61a8892b490e8f6fd9ec4e60008f">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Assurance Evidence Assessment" id="id-f7b1410300485ff3a1f03dc2cb35ce34">
                <documentation>Evaluate available evidence against the established assurance approach and criteria.

Assurance Evidence Assessment evaluates available evidence against the established approach and criteria. It produces the assessed basis from which a legitimate conclusion may be determined, retaining qualifications and evidentiary limits. The responsibility is evaluative rather than the operational production of the source information or remediation of what it reveals.

**Boundary**

Assessment is distinct from conclusion determination; unavailable or insufficient evidence must remain explicit.</documentation>
