            <folder name="[CT3] Health Service Implementation Planning" id="id-b7993f05a9c74b639bf412204b38696f">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Health Service Implementation Planning" id="id-a4cdf13bec0556e680f9abb2a60fe989">
                <documentation>Establish and coordinate surrounding organisational/service changes needed to introduce or materially change the service.

Health Service Implementation Planning establishes and coordinates the organisational and surrounding service changes needed for introduction or material change. It considers how the service fits its environment, complementing modelling's establishment support with an alignment view of interdependent change. Its purpose is coherence of the planned transition rather than ownership of every change activity.

**Boundary**

Planning does not perform all supporting changes or define the authoritative service offering.</documentation>
