            <folder name="[CT3] Health Service Resource Identification" id="id-e62cd4a57ee24cbf87f495d26edca22f">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Health Service Resource Identification" id="id-289650d19a325d8f90b7e7f66b54490f">
                <documentation>Identify required workforce, facilities, equipment, clinical technology, ICT, administration and support resources without owning them.

This capability establishes the resources a service requires across workforce, facilities, equipment, clinical technology, ICT and support. It makes resource needs visible in the service's alignment context without treating identification as procurement, ownership or allocation. Required resources can therefore be discussed distinctly from resources presently available or deployed.

**Boundary**

Identifying resources does not operate them, assign them to care or establish collective service readiness.</documentation>
