          <folder name="[CT2] Health Service Modelling" id="id-48042039380a4431a3f51d23493f5524">
            <folder name="[CT3] Health Service Capability Identification" id="id-9dc1c127798e464f9052fa1568df3e0d">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Health Service Capability Identification" id="id-f24b2bd3966552018ad898a63b48cc4c">
                <documentation>Identify the ordinary business abilities needed to satisfy the service need across clinical, workforce, facility, technology, information and support concerns.

This capability identifies the ordinary business abilities a proposed service needs across clinical, workforce, facility, information, technology and support concerns. It broadens service modelling beyond a clinical description to the conditions needed for viability. Its contribution is an understanding of required abilities, leaving their fulfilment and governing authority with the appropriate responsibilities.

**Boundary**

The word capability here does not allocate Harmonia CT tiers or establish new catalogue elements.</documentation>
