            <folder name="[CT3] Health Service Continuous Improvement" id="id-c83d35c3f94647f896d555be0dafe8ab">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Health Service Continuous Improvement" id="id-bc65f74c11945694ad12dc44fe736024">
                <documentation>Evaluate the established service and identify correction/improvement needs that may feed back into modelling and implementation support.

This capability evaluates an established service and identifies correction or improvement needs across its service-wide purpose. It allows experience of actual operation to inform reconsideration of the service model and implementation support. The scope is broader than reporting a clinical-quality finding, while remaining anchored to the service being improved.

**Boundary**

It does not establish generic Continuous Improvement placement or transfer the authority of specialist activities affected by improvement.</documentation>
