            <folder name="[CT3] Health Service Implementation Support" id="id-01045b498a66469d98aea7bfd3db5051">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Health Service Implementation Support" id="id-1a11f717fc015997ba1e963cbaac0b8a">
                <documentation>Support establishment of the framed service through applicable organisational preparation and programmes of work.

Health Service Implementation Support assists establishment of the framed service through organisational preparation and programmes of work. It connects the service model to practical readiness for introduction while recognising that recruitment, training, equipment and technology changes retain their own owners. Support therefore contributes to establishment without becoming an all-purpose implementation authority.

**Boundary**

It does not absorb HR, facilities, procurement or ICT responsibilities or establish operational-readiness ancestry.</documentation>
