            <folder name="[CT3] Health Service Need Identification" id="id-819ac09abe5046c290e5affedae8e41e">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Health Service Need Identification" id="id-10df1dc1dfd455a981b3e7c5ccafdf4d">
                <documentation>Establish an unmet health-service need requiring response.

Health Service Need Identification establishes the unmet service need for which an organisational response is being considered. It gives service modelling a reason grounded in what is missing rather than beginning with a predetermined solution. That identified need can then frame the abilities and resources required without assuming that a new offering has already been established.

**Boundary**

Identifying need does not define an offering, approve funding or determine the surrounding implementation arrangements.</documentation>
