        <folder name="[CT1] Individual Care Delivery" id="id-c75bf3419a944256ab97923f509b9e16">
          <folder name="[CT2] Clinical Determination" id="id-c2c8edbcfd6643b3875fa262816d1436">
            <folder name="[CT3] Clinical Finding Interpretation" id="id-71b8071988804c749856596592be809d">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Finding Interpretation" id="id-94f7aff6888a52d08db90e33e52c3fd3">
                <documentation>Interpret observed clinical findings and their significance for the individual care concern.

**Overview**

Interpret observed clinical findings and their significance for the individual care concern. The proposed decomposition separates this outcome from the other responsibilities within Clinical Determination.

**Intent**

Make the clinical significance of observations intelligible before diagnostic or response decisions are taken.

**Boundary**

Does not itself establish a diagnosis, prescribe intervention or confer this clinical responsibility on Harmonia.</documentation>
