            <folder name="[CT3] Diagnosis &amp; Problem Determination" id="id-0c5811d6ce584691b6b1684f1dfc28cc">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Diagnosis &amp; Problem Determination" id="id-0c22ff432234514c88760d28241e3a44">
                <documentation>Establish and qualify the clinical problems or diagnoses applicable to an individual.

**Overview**

Establish and qualify the clinical problems or diagnoses applicable to an individual. The proposed decomposition separates this outcome from the other responsibilities within Clinical Determination.

**Intent**

Establish the clinically accountable problem statement that subsequent care decisions address.

**Boundary**

Clinical determination remains with the mandated professional; a coded record is not evidence that Harmonia made the diagnosis.</documentation>
