            <folder name="[CT3] Health Risk &amp; Prognostic Determination" id="id-0977f059d59c414cab5e91fb60c2de81">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Health Risk &amp; Prognostic Determination" id="id-246a682df0be5a21a11b800c51461501">
                <documentation>Establish clinically meaningful risk and expected-course judgements for an individual.

**Overview**

Establish clinically meaningful risk and expected-course judgements for an individual. The proposed decomposition separates this outcome from the other responsibilities within Clinical Determination.

**Intent**

Make anticipated clinical risk and course explicit for the individual care concern.

**Boundary**

Risk/prognostic judgement is distinct from operational urgency, source-information authority and platform assurance.</documentation>
