          <folder name="[CT2] Individual Care Planning" id="id-dd573d2255be433296861faa771da104">
            <folder name="[CT3] Care Goal Definition" id="id-160a9d892f0549379592488d12cf8430">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Care Goal Definition" id="id-c45b599ec97b544d8049f3bbc65859ca">
                <documentation>Establish the intended outcomes and priorities against which an individual care response is planned.

**Overview**

Establish the intended outcomes and priorities against which an individual care response is planned. The proposed decomposition separates this outcome from the other responsibilities within Individual Care Planning.

**Intent**

Establish the intended clinical benefit and priorities against which care responses can be considered.

**Boundary**

Goal definition remains distinct from selecting an intervention and from recording an externally agreed care plan.</documentation>
