            <folder name="[CT3] Care Response Planning" id="id-04c73cae245c4893a809bfb9162c6546">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Care Response Planning" id="id-2d8ad28ce73e58448e5456abe7a8b9a0">
                <documentation>Determine the intended clinical response and its sequencing in relation to agreed care goals.

**Overview**

Determine the intended clinical response and its sequencing in relation to agreed care goals. The proposed decomposition separates this outcome from the other responsibilities within Individual Care Planning.

**Intent**

Make the intended clinical response coherent in relation to the agreed care goals.

**Boundary**

Planning is distinct from intervention delivery and from the operational definition of a synthetic activity.</documentation>
