          <folder name="[CT2] Individual Health Assessment" id="id-fc84ca01b1fd424f8d37100f0984ca94">
            <folder name="[CT3] Clinical Examination" id="id-d1f4e791592a44b19dd3a77cd71ba17f">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Examination" id="id-abe9e3230f6d5577a13fca453e624a85">
                <documentation>Establish health findings through clinical examination.

Clinical Examination establishes findings through examination of the individual. It distinguishes directly acquired clinical knowledge from the historical account and the measurement-focused contribution of its assessment siblings. Its outcome is a set of examination findings that can inform clinical interpretation, irrespective of the setting or profession exercising the ability.

**Boundary**

An examination finding is not itself a diagnosis, care plan or performed treatment.</documentation>
