            <folder name="[CT3] Health Status Measurement" id="id-f3f47986728f4331872549370f714759">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Health Status Measurement" id="id-697b75a82c515e48b6ba8de37109dc7f">
                <documentation>Establish individual health observations or measurements.

Health Status Measurement establishes observations or measurements of an individual's health. Its contribution to assessment is evidence about the measured state, with a purpose distinct from developing a view over time or deciding the clinical meaning of a result. Measurements can inform both present assessment and later monitoring without collapsing those abilities.

**Boundary**

Obtaining a value does not establish a temporal trend or the clinical significance of that value.</documentation>
