            <folder name="[CT3] Health Service Demand Assessment" id="id-2d076eaef9b3484db96415f5c1bd2310">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Health Service Demand Assessment" id="id-3f079cb41bb05f1f82699c5e1feacfb7">
                <documentation>Assess current/expected health-service demand across a population, geography, service domain or health-system context.

Health Service Demand Assessment establishes a view of current or expected demand within a population, geography or service context. It translates relevant evidence into a demand judgement rather than assuming population-health state directly determines service requirements. Its assumptions and scope matter because capacity planning depends on what demand has actually been assessed.

**Boundary**

System-level demand is distinct from a particular person's care requirement and does not itself determine planned capacity.</documentation>
