            <folder name="[CT3] Health Information Compartment Assurance" id="id-f45f3d7c266246e79e2b298441f75a01">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Health Information Compartment Assurance" id="id-58ef3273bf3d5fecbfe098646bcdff4a">
                <documentation>Assure appropriate establishment and application of compartmentalisation without establishing access decisions.

This capability evaluates whether contextual information compartments are appropriately established and applied. It treats the correctness of the grouping as a concern distinct from permission to disclose a particular item. Such assurance can make compartment use more trustworthy without changing the business relationships that define membership.

**Boundary**

Assuring compartmentalisation does not establish access decisions or sensitivity classification.</documentation>
