            <folder name="[CT3] Health Information Safeguarding" id="id-f1dc8e594367488792cb79e66a4792e4">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Health Information Safeguarding" id="id-c53bfdd40a525de3adf5de52aa2b4adc">
                <documentation>Ensure information and its operational environment are protected and resilient against loss, compromise, inappropriate access or operational failure.

Health Information Safeguarding protects information and its operational environment against loss, compromise, inappropriate access and operational failure. It frames resilience and protection as organisational outcomes, allowing physical controls, recovery arrangements and testing to contribute without defining the capability as a product. The concern is broader than any individual access transaction.

**Boundary**

Estate protection remains distinct from evaluating privacy consequences and from assurance conclusions about service delivery.</documentation>
