            <folder name="[CT3] Information Model Discovery" id="id-7323a087a08f4d9490ffa0651c9b21cf">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Information Model Discovery" id="id-4d9ce431849e5c9ea87fc5e7798bba22">
                <documentation>Identify information models relevant to the organisation’s health-information needs.

Information Model Discovery identifies candidate models relevant to the organisation's health-information needs. It supports informed standards governance by making applicable possibilities visible before adoption. Its business purpose is finding suitable semantic frames rather than selecting a software representation or assuming every discovered model should be used.

**Boundary**

Discovery does not adopt a model, establish compliance or grant it organisational authority.</documentation>
