            <folder name="[CT3] Information Model Education" id="id-c84e425fa1c046628ca6b26b1261b977">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Information Model Education" id="id-9ecbd74dbb335bd494a718d1402fd973">
                <documentation>Support organisational understanding and appropriate use of adopted information models.

Information Model Education supports understanding and appropriate use of adopted models. It addresses the people and practice dimension of semantic consistency: a published model is not necessarily a model understood in the contexts where it is applied. Its responsibility therefore complements adoption and compliance without becoming either.

**Boundary**

Educational support neither changes the authoritative model nor establishes that actual use complies with it.</documentation>
