            <folder name="[CT3] Information Model Governance Oversight" id="id-3df5d04e07d242b5a2279a2478e531a0">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Information Model Governance Oversight" id="id-3ecc7c53a2e95a11a3efe3ff59ff50e4">
                <documentation>Oversee and evaluate effectiveness, consistency and appropriate operation of information-model governance.

This capability evaluates the effectiveness and consistency of information-model governance itself. It asks whether discovery, adoption and use are being governed appropriately, rather than repeating each operational peer. Its purpose is coherent oversight of the arrangements that give models standing and guide their application.

**Boundary**

Oversight does not itself perform discovery, adoption, education or compliance activities.</documentation>
