            <folder name="[CT3] Standards Adoption" id="id-49b4cc97bd0f4ad09537dee847f86ee9">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Standards Adoption" id="id-edd55a066905575992dc0c06fd79de80">
                <documentation>Adopt applicable standards within the organisation.

Standards Adoption establishes which applicable standards the organisation adopts. It gives standards an intentional place in organisational practice rather than allowing familiar products or conventions to define requirements by default. The business responsibility concerns adoption in context, including standards whose effects extend beyond information representation.

**Boundary**

Adoption does not establish a complete standards lifecycle taxonomy or perform the distinct identification of broader standards impacts.</documentation>
