            <folder name="[CT3] Standards Impact Identification" id="id-f5c75ada91c74071970368164107c8b8">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Standards Impact Identification" id="id-9e57b7abee445a809059938014ef98aa">
                <documentation>Identify standards impacts across clinical/work practice, permitted medications, procedures, policy, safety, obligations and reporting as applicable.

Standards Impact Identification recognises the consequences of standards for relevant organisational activity. Impacts may concern clinical practice, medications, procedures, policy, safety, obligations or reporting, so the responsibility cannot be reduced to technical compatibility. It makes those consequences visible for the responsible capabilities to consider within their own authority.

**Boundary**

Identifying an impact neither adopts the standard nor acquires the operational authority needed to respond to it.</documentation>
