          <folder name="[CT3] Governed Operational Activity Design" id="id-4f6d5bcc648747aba219139d86889229">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Governed Operational Activity Design" id="id-e285e2523d1f5fe488af1b4735d4a49b">
              <documentation>Define the information context, expected outcomes, continuation conditions and housekeeping of governed operational activity.

**Overview**

An activity needs a fulfilment definition even when only one bounded execution unit is involved. This capability specifies its semantic envelope while execution and event delivery remain separate responsibilities.

**Intent**

Make the expected information and fulfilment basis of an undertaking explicit before it executes.

**Boundary**

An activity definition is neither an orchestrator nor a choreographer. It does not choose clinical care or dynamically invent execution logic.</documentation>
