          <folder name="[CT3] Significant Activity Audit Capture" id="id-f1608af7c3344cadb82ea6c5a4f6ea01">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Significant Activity Audit Capture" id="id-24a125b569e45888bf313cd39d435fba">
              <documentation>Capture required security- and information-significant activity as governed, attributable audit evidence.

**Overview**

Mandatory evidence capture has its own policy-governed platform authority and must remain possible when the audited identity is denied an action. The captured fact is distinguished from debug output and the identity whose activity is recorded.

**Intent**

Ensure required significant activity evidence can be captured under the authority specifically assigned to that responsibility.

**Boundary**

The specific intrinsic authority for mandatory audit capture is not generalised to other activities. Capture is not an assurance finding and cannot expose unmasked PHI in diagnostic logs.</documentation>
