          <folder name="[Feature] Entity-Relative Activity Coordination" id="id-796310ac8e0c4481aa3c94b932cf1ed9">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Entity-Relative Activity Coordination" id="id-690bcf58be875ffc83126a9d288b2df5">
              <documentation>Sequence applicable behaviours for an identifiable entity input while preserving its operational reference frame.

**Overview**

Interest matching can select multiple behaviours while the entity progresses one input at a time. Each behaviour uses a fresh managed information context.

**Boundary**

Fan-out is not concurrent execution; clinical decisions and originating information remain with their owners.</documentation>
