          <folder name="[Feature] Governance Requirement Version Publication" id="id-422da4983ff84ae6906ed1d803e44095">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Governance Requirement Version Publication" id="id-012a49f6e1ce5f4094fd4870dfd281d4">
              <documentation>Publish attributable versions and applicability of externally approved governing requirements.

**Overview**

Operational and assurance consumers need to identify the governing basis they used rather than silently substitute a current rule for a historical one.

**Boundary**

Publication does not confer requirement approval, authorisation policy or assurance-criteria authority.</documentation>
              <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="proposal:feature-governance-requirement-version-publication"/>
              <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="HCM-FT-governance-requirement-version-publication"/>
