          <folder name="[Feature] Independent Evidence Assessment &amp; Adjudication" id="id-0850e7d6fd0c46a6ac944c68d2954e02">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Independent Evidence Assessment &amp; Adjudication" id="id-74297fcf6597537fb193578f0eefca8d">
              <documentation>Independently establish assurance context, assess evidence and adjudicate findings under applicable criteria.

**Overview**

The Feature unifies the review frame while retaining the three distinct canonical Functions and the boundary between criterion-level assessment and reportable conclusion.

**Boundary**

No new assurance Function or clinical-adequacy mandate is introduced; insufficient evidence establishes neither satisfaction nor non-satisfaction.</documentation>
