          <folder name="[Feature] Mandatory Significant Activity Audit Capture" id="id-1829a14bc63f49ada521b94ba856f857">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Mandatory Significant Activity Audit Capture" id="id-a07c25a127ca5917984623d75092c14d">
              <documentation>Capture required significant activity evidence using the specifically governed authoritative audit-capture boundary.

**Overview**

The actor whose action is recorded need not be entitled to persist the audit. Required capture uses its own established authority and failure can block the governed operation.

**Boundary**

Specific audit authority is not borrowed from the audited identity or generalised to other operations.</documentation>
