          <folder name="[Feature] Operation-Bound Authorisation Enforcement" id="id-68616cb8a4f944c1a0acbe6856252448">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Operation-Bound Authorisation Enforcement" id="id-edcdc7b12cc25092aee8b7c197674755">
              <documentation>Apply effective policy at the governed action boundary and reject actions lacking sufficient authority.

**Overview**

Consistent enforcement is required across mutation, access, execution and administration rather than relying on each caller to voluntarily invoke a check.

**Boundary**

Consumes trusted identity and criteria; it does not authenticate or establish clinical privilege from directory roles.</documentation>
