          <folder name="[Feature] Synthetic Task Orchestration" id="id-3f3718856f764683af8af81cec8ac429">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Synthetic Task Orchestration" id="id-a230f00f87e65345adb868f557cee471">
              <documentation>Execute non-human, automated platform activity units and sequence orchestration.

---

## History

### Feature Overview — predecessor explanation

Synthetic Task orchestration governs non-human executable work and its sequencing. This technical work meaning remains distinct from human Work Orders, clinical worklists and external systems' generic task terminology; incomplete stalled/failed Process paths are not supplied by convention.</documentation>
