          <folder name="[Feature] Trusted Identity Context Intake" id="id-f25c9473849c43348f4e961a84c0dad1">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Trusted Identity Context Intake" id="id-9caab2bbf6365d30999ddb7592dfc543">
              <documentation>Accept and qualify externally authenticated identity context for Harmonia-governed operations.

**Overview**

The boundary between WHO and WHAT remains explicit: an external identity assertion is verified as trusted input before internal authorisation is resolved.

**Boundary**

Harmonia does not become an authentication or credential-issuance provider.</documentation>
