          <folder name="[Feature] Workflow Timeout &amp; Escalation Oversight" id="id-e9caf4605bf0491a9d8722e653fec45c">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Workflow Timeout &amp; Escalation Oversight" id="id-bef177231eed51078d4244176d3aced4">
              <documentation>Supervise operational deadlines, executing automated timeout notifications and supervisory escalations.

---

## History

### Feature Overview — predecessor explanation

Timeout oversight observes deadlines and initiates the established coordination response to stalled activity. It is management of progression rather than an assurance conclusion, and escalation does not grant the coordinator authority over the clinical meaning of the underlying work.</documentation>
