          <folder name="[CT1] Human Collaboration &amp; Work Enablement" id="id-a1e41aa4773e45059fa6208c2206a3cf">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Human Collaboration &amp; Work Enablement" id="id-0bac088d5c4358b99269265e43c4d89e">
              <documentation>Enable contextual human interaction, collaboration and the definition and progression of governed operational activity.

**Overview**

People discuss information, inspect it, make authorised decisions and undertake work. Those interactions need reusable coordination and temporal context, while entity-relative progression and activity design retain distinct semantics from message exchange and screen rendering.

**Intent**

Allow people and automated participants to interact and progress authorised work with intelligible context and accountability.

**Boundary**

Conversation is not a clinical record, presentation is not authority, and generic work coordination does not determine clinical work or own its outcome.</documentation>
              <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="proposal:bec-human-collaboration-work-enablement"/>
              <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="HCM-BEC-human-collaboration-work-enablement"/>
