          <folder name="[CT2] Care Access Transaction Enablement" id="id-3cad06406e3d4b8eb1e74ecc2d1afad0">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Care Access Transaction Enablement" id="id-957fa549536c5a02b16c2b8d7fed3ad4">
              <documentation>Coordinate the intake, care-request disposition and appointment information through which a person accesses care.

**Overview**

Coordinate the intake, care-request disposition and appointment information through which a person accesses care. Its constituent abilities distinguish Client-Centred Administration; Referral Administration; Scheduling Administration.

**Intent**

Make an access request and its disposition traceable without confusing a booking with care responsibility or delivery.

**Boundary**

A referral requests care responsibility; an appointment concerns a booking. Neither establishes care delivery or host booking authority.</documentation>
