          <folder name="[CT2] Care Financial Information Enablement" id="id-6aad91bc31e94e959ada0e040faaf77a">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Care Financial Information Enablement" id="id-4ddd19075297571c9aeee1382d935a72">
              <documentation>Represent coverage context and convey care-activity evidence to responsible funding and charging systems.

**Overview**

Represent coverage context and convey care-activity evidence to responsible funding and charging systems. Its constituent abilities distinguish Funding &amp; Coverage Administration; Clinical Charging &amp; Claims Administration.

**Intent**

Give responsible financial systems the care-activity and coverage context they need without creating another financial authority.

**Boundary**

Adjacent information participation does not provide financial governance, coverage adjudication or a billing platform.</documentation>
