          <folder name="[CT2] Collaborative Interaction Enablement" id="id-4f38a7eaaf1e4fd2bce5f1daeea983e0">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Collaborative Interaction Enablement" id="id-cbc054c958a05feda3487a42caa57375">
              <documentation>Support contextual discussion and human interaction with governed information and activity.

**Overview**

Support contextual discussion and human interaction with governed information and activity. Its constituent abilities distinguish Clinical Collaboration; General Collaboration; Presentation Services.

**Intent**

Give participants a useful discussion and interaction context without turning the communication medium into a clinical authority.

**Boundary**

Collaboration control, collaboration operations and general presentation remain distinct; a discussion or screen is not a new clinical fact.</documentation>
