          <folder name="[CT2] Facility &amp; Episodic Care Integration" id="id-a8d6b887a3fb49cfbaeb40377f04604b">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Facility &amp; Episodic Care Integration" id="id-10e11a4f3fb85b80be5c8970415e8125">
              <documentation>Provide the context assemblies and boundary integration needed for facility presentations and bounded care episodes.

**Overview**

Provide the context assemblies and boundary integration needed for facility presentations and bounded care episodes. Its constituent abilities distinguish Acute Care; Emergency Care; Inpatient Care; Ambulatory Care; Surgical &amp; Procedural Care.

**Intent**

Make presentation- and episode-specific information available to the responsible care team in its applicable context.

**Boundary**

Acute, emergency and inpatient perspectives overlap; each capability owns its named integration purpose rather than a population or clinical workflow.</documentation>
