          <folder name="[CT2] Longitudinal &amp; Community Care Integration" id="id-b5cfcd15ae00493d867cb91a33ba1b95">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Longitudinal &amp; Community Care Integration" id="id-6a2eb8694bb1540b9d1f64051ee43dc3">
              <documentation>Support continuity, remote participation and preventive follow-up through appropriately assembled and exchanged care context.

**Overview**

Support continuity, remote participation and preventive follow-up through appropriately assembled and exchanged care context. Its constituent abilities distinguish Primary Care; Community Care; Outreach Care; Remote &amp; Virtual Care; Preventive Care.

**Intent**

Support continuity when care information must follow the person across providers, visits and distance.

**Boundary**

Longitudinal purpose does not make these care contexts exclusive. Outreach location and remote mode remain distinct from source clinical responsibility.</documentation>
