          <folder name="[CT2] Operational Activity &amp; Temporal Enablement" id="id-961c153fb3ac42fdabeb8fac0e3099c4">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Operational Activity &amp; Temporal Enablement" id="id-4e4a405d0abf537089c1bcabb41669d2">
              <documentation>Progress governed operational work in identifiable activity and temporal contexts.

**Overview**

Progress governed operational work in identifiable activity and temporal contexts. Its constituent abilities distinguish Workflow &amp; Activity Coordination; Calendar Management.

**Intent**

Keep work progression and its timing intelligible across human and synthetic undertakings.

**Boundary**

Work Order is human doing, To Do is human review/update/approval and Task is synthetic work. Projection does not own authoritative bookings or rosters.</documentation>
