          <folder name="[CT2] Operational Workforce Coordination" id="id-93a8e375340b455c8f2c82f9ebbf7fef">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Operational Workforce Coordination" id="id-67d1729bf7565773bc62694f3cdc1957">
              <documentation>Make workforce availability, coverage and eligible operational work participation usable in coordination.

**Overview**

Make workforce availability, coverage and eligible operational work participation usable in coordination. Its constituent abilities distinguish Clinical Workforce Management; Clinical Rostering; Mobile Staff Management; On-Call Management; Work Allocation &amp; Dispatch.

**Intent**

Support eligible operational participation using qualified availability and coverage information.

**Boundary**

Source rosters remain separately authoritative; operational dispatch does not acquire clinical-work allocation authority.</documentation>
