            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Semantic &amp; Reference Knowledge Enablement" id="id-bfc2580cd5a15519b21c0118c610d8ca">
              <documentation>Govern the definitions, terminology and reference content that make healthcare information consistently interpretable.

**Overview**

Govern the definitions, terminology and reference content that make healthcare information consistently interpretable. Its constituent abilities distinguish Clinical Knowledge Services; Information Design Governance.

**Intent**

Keep structural meaning, terminology bindings and approved reference content consistent enough for shared interpretation.

**Boundary**

Definition semantics, mutable approved content and runtime policy decisions retain distinct ownership.</documentation>
