          <folder name="[CT3] Device Association" id="id-5bbe6ccf089445a0948b98083a6663b7">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Device Association" id="id-1cfea61cbb7a5750b32bdf93debae923">
              <documentation>Associating clinical devices with patients, beds, or rooms.

**Overview**

A device can be associated with different patients and care places at different times. Qualified association and its lineage allow observations to be interpreted against the applicable binding rather than the current assignment alone.

**Intent**

Allow a device-originated item to be associated with the correct subject and place at the relevant time.

**Boundary**

Represents qualified device-to-subject/place association without owning those subjects or observations.</documentation>
