          <folder name="[CT3] Organisation Contact" id="id-64c6f84986af402d81f7ea64637f3366">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Organisation Contact" id="id-7d47194b90fa59628cd4b1a830f1b111">
              <documentation>Maintaining verified administrative and clinical communication channels.

**Overview**

Verified facility contact channels make an organisation reachable for appropriate administrative and clinical communication. The contact record says how it may be reached; recipient qualification and disclosure policy govern a particular use.

**Intent**

Provide verified channels for reaching the intended healthcare organisation.

**Boundary**

Contact validity is distinct from clinical recipient eligibility and policy permission.</documentation>
