          <folder name="[CT3] Organisational Structure" id="id-4f44a68e53c7485588341249d8277b29">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Organisational Structure" id="id-975bd55fc43e538faf4920f7bace43f6">
              <documentation>Managing parent-child hierarchies, departments, and corporate relationships.

**Overview**

Departments, divisions and regional networks need qualified structural relationships that can be traversed and understood over time. Structural membership is distinct from physical location and from authority to manage another organisation.

**Intent**

Make organisational relationships navigable without confusing structure with ownership or physical containment.

**Boundary**

Structural relationships do not acquire ownership of every related organisation or service.</documentation>
              <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="proposal:bec-organisational-structure"/>
              <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="HCM-BEC-organisational-structure"/>
