          <folder name="[CT3] Provider Engagement" id="id-870b78e7a5a84ddbbbb5e9eb21d01d54">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Provider Engagement" id="id-30b102fdb0fd5f788ddf1812fe82689d">
              <documentation>Capturing terms of service and clinical privilege agreements.

**Overview**

Engagement information represents the terms and externally granted practice privileges under which a provider participates. This differs from who the practitioner is and from whether a particular operation is authorised now.

**Intent**

Make the externally established terms and privilege standing of provider participation available without granting it.

**Boundary**

Records externally granted service terms and privileges; it does not independently grant those privileges.</documentation>
