          <folder name="[CT3] Service Eligibility Definition" id="id-0a4d73cddb6c46b6a35fb6c3c7413fde">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Service Eligibility Definition" id="id-36a039fd097b5360a1ab9dcad34f9a97">
              <documentation>Capturing referral criteria, catchment boundaries, and clinical eligibility.

**Overview**

Published catchment, referral and clinical eligibility conditions explain the intended audience and access constraints of an offering. Their representation supports responsible assessment without deciding acceptance or clinical priority.

**Intent**

Make the governed intake and catchment conditions available to the party responsible for access decisions.

**Boundary**

Represents governed eligibility criteria; it does not make clinical acceptance or triage decisions.</documentation>
