          <folder name="[CT3] Service Provision Relationship" id="id-789863afcaa54e8e8e199daf4196cdeb">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Service Provision Relationship" id="id-3006d0eeedfd5899af44611e8fbda5b4">
              <documentation>Binding health services to specific organizations, locations, and practitioner roles.

**Overview**

Service provision joins a named offering to the organisations, places and practitioner roles through which it is provided. The mapping is the owned concern; the identity and meaning of each mapped participant remain with its established capability.

**Intent**

Make it clear which provider delivers which service at which place and through which participating roles.

**Boundary**

Owns mapping associations, retaining the owners of each participating entity.</documentation>
              <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="proposal:bec-service-provision-relationship"/>
              <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="HCM-BEC-service-provision-relationship"/>
              <property key="v0.2 / LaTeX Label" value="cap:bec-service-provision-relationship"/>
              <property key="v0.2 / Construct Type" value="capability"/>
              <property key="v0.2 / Capability Tier" value="CT3"/>
              <property key="v0.2 / Architectural Status" value="Proposed"/>
              <property key="v0.2 / Record State" value="superseded"/>
