              <folder name="[Feature] Care Goal &amp; Plan Progression Representation" id="id-8581d170cae94d3bb46f81c1c17556c5">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Care Goal &amp; Plan Progression Representation" id="id-3a7f53d246f6577c904c5980bdc3cb81">
                  <documentation>Represent externally agreed care goals, participants and plan changes with their effective standing.

**Overview**

Plan ingestion/distribution is complemented by the ability to distinguish the applicable goal and plan context as a shared plan progresses.

**Boundary**

Representing a goal does not choose treatment, determine clinical completion or grant plan approval authority.</documentation>
