            <folder name="[CT3] Community Care Coordination" id="id-5a181797837249a282063a62ea46f410">
              <folder name="[Feature] Community Care Plan Synchronization" id="id-99d625cb4ff943449f6cb79f949d9f6d">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Community Care Plan Synchronization" id="id-ab77a6c8e9d9547cb46e0d7fdcf06500">
                  <documentation>Synchronize community care plan updates between hospital outreach teams and community health organizations.

Community plan synchronisation keeps hospital outreach and community participants informed of established plan changes. It supports shared clinical intent without allowing synchronisation to become authority to choose that intent or allocate clinical work.</documentation>
