              <folder name="[Feature] Demographic Update Ingestion" id="id-3078b9a5dc744aa598a374d7686da238">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Demographic Update Ingestion" id="id-288b859447af59cb9a00b36056bba57e">
                  <documentation>Ingest and validate patient admission and registration updates from external PAS systems.

Demographic ingestion receives administrative changes from upstream admission and registration systems. It makes externally established updates available for governed processing without treating each incoming assertion as an independent master-person adjudication by Harmonia.</documentation>
