              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Client Intake &amp; Demographic Update" id="id-714b37e59d095316bb94389ebbc14e33">
                <documentation>Administer the established client intake &amp; demographic update information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority.

**Overview**

Administer the established client intake &amp; demographic update information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer the established client intake &amp; demographic update information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
