            <folder name="[CT3] Screening and Immunisation Enablement" id="id-388aa6c191554484827f1fabcc438efa">
              <folder name="[Feature] Immunisation Event Submission" id="id-2b5e05cc23b747f0954930721a5e600e">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Immunisation Event Submission" id="id-9bff89837605529e9289be57afb905d6">
                  <documentation>Ingest point-of-care immunisation administration records and syndicate to national immunization registers.

Immunisation submission connects a source-recorded administration event with the national register context. It supports continuity and reporting without performing the immunisation or making successful transmission equivalent to every downstream registry outcome.</documentation>
