              <folder name="[Feature] Communication Audit Logging" id="id-9dcf5cb775b6460ea09272d1952d4ac4">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Communication Audit Logging" id="id-47bd63bf8323578c86caf2ae6a18f3d8">
                  <documentation>Maintain an enduring, non-PHI, tamper-evident log of all clinical communication transactions.

Communication audit evidence preserves the attributable transaction history required for scrutiny of clinical communication. It records meaningful communication facts under the zero-PHI constraints rather than turning the audit trail into a copy of message content or a permanent diagnostic trace.</documentation>
