            <folder name="[CT3] Clinical Documentation Lifecycle Administration" id="id-1516056ecc394ff2b87ac1d146990276">
              <folder name="[Feature] Clinical Document Ingestion" id="id-c6c8c03b2cf14bdda7b6f6cbf54c957f">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Document Ingestion" id="id-1148b4e52cbc5303a14f52125a5ae281">
                  <documentation>Ingest structured and unstructured clinical documents (discharge summaries, consult notes, letters).

Clinical document ingestion receives authored documents into governed information management. It supports both structured and unstructured contributions while preserving that receipt establishes a managed contribution, not independent clinical verification of every assertion in the document.</documentation>
