              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Documentation Lifecycle Administration" id="id-31701b65e27a544297e8b3807896433e">
                <documentation>Administer ingestion, indexing, versioning, supersession and governed availability of clinical documentation.

**Overview**

Administer ingestion, indexing, versioning, supersession and governed availability of clinical documentation. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer ingestion, indexing, versioning, supersession and governed availability of clinical documentation.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
