              <folder name="[Feature] Laboratory &amp; Imaging Result Distribution" id="id-0f95582dbaf145ffa40d430ef707f2c0">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Laboratory &amp; Imaging Result Distribution" id="id-8cc1576660195c098afae0eb858958bd">
                  <documentation>Reliably distribute structured diagnostic reports (pathology, radiology) to ordering clinicians and designated secondary recipients.

Result distribution connects established diagnostic reports with ordering and designated secondary recipients. It supports continuity of diagnostic information across care settings while retaining the distinction between delivery, recipient review and the clinical decision based on the result.</documentation>
