            <folder name="[CT3] Diagnostic Workflow Management" id="id-f94d6212e06444c38d4debefebd4cfa1">
              <folder name="[Feature] Diagnostic Preliminary &amp; Corrected Report Handling" id="id-9818729e19114d929a4505b2e1b6c4cf">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Diagnostic Preliminary &amp; Corrected Report Handling" id="id-790a8b7d12b65899b81a59248847861d">
                  <documentation>Receive, qualify and distribute preliminary, corrected and addendum diagnostic information with its relationship to prior reports.

**Overview**

The finalised-report Feature remains unchanged. The broader documented diagnostic behaviour needs a separate frame for information whose preliminary or correction standing is material.

**Boundary**

Does not originate diagnostic interpretation or silently overwrite a previously received report.</documentation>
