              <folder name="[Feature] Diagnostic Report Ingestion &amp; Binding" id="id-40f9a4987ab740abbcc6c6eeeb99f205">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Diagnostic Report Ingestion &amp; Binding" id="id-edd2707ca7e458b190c0e857d51bc695">
                  <documentation>Ingest finalized laboratory and radiology reports, verifying content integrity and binding them to the parent order.

Report ingestion binds a finalised diagnostic contribution to the order it answers and verifies content integrity. The report's professional standing comes from its diagnostic source; successful ingestion does not independently authorise its findings or establish a patient-level clinical conclusion.</documentation>
