              <folder name="[Feature] Diagnostic Request Correlation" id="id-d6c7d49d2cc045e59edab5992dca3d14">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Diagnostic Request Correlation" id="id-6d5eae5946d45e069850870062bc6b74">
                  <documentation>Correlate diagnostic test orders with collected clinical specimens and patient encounters.

Diagnostic request correlation connects the order with its specimen and encounter context. It helps distinguish evidence belonging to the intended fulfilment from superficially similar results, without treating association as proof of specimen suitability or diagnostic interpretation.</documentation>
