              <folder name="[Feature] Encounter History Retrieval" id="id-e7782c0d729d4e98ace62b5faf3ad12f">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Encounter History Retrieval" id="id-9240e1a4cc6f53c4b6f1b8d0b36a96db">
                  <documentation>Expose qualified episode, movement and encounter-history context.

**Overview**

Consumers need to interpret prior care-place and episode relationships, not just the latest encounter state; historical retrieval remains bounded by source attribution and access policy.

**Boundary**

A historical view does not retrospectively alter clinical events or acquire longitudinal-record ownership.</documentation>
