              <folder name="[Feature] Encounter State Progression" id="id-832fe844287341ce98c06ef573bde06c">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Encounter State Progression" id="id-26d1c6dd72ab5d6198424ef2ad44a966">
                  <documentation>Track encounter status transitions (PLANNED → ARRIVED → IN_PROGRESS → ON_LEAVE → DISCHARGED).

Encounter progression preserves the difference between planned, arrived, active, leave and discharged circumstances. These states make administrative activity interpretable without implying a clinical outcome. The source's ON_LEAVE transition detail remains incomplete in the corresponding Process and is not repaired here.</documentation>
