              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Medication Order &amp; Dispense Management" id="id-ea9da64cb51253f1aabacc59253b8db8">
                <documentation>Administer the established medication order &amp; dispense management information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority.

**Overview**

Administer the established medication order &amp; dispense management information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer the established medication order &amp; dispense management information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
