            <folder name="[CT3] Medication Therapy Provision and Monitoring" id="id-d76b19a123d041239e365cffb1f034b3">
              <folder name="[Feature] Medication Administration Tracking" id="id-98a86f5490b0498eb38e47c575f6e412">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Medication Administration Tracking" id="id-fdf1c3f9f36351b5b37d22467ed821b4">
                  <documentation>Distribute medication therapy orders, dispensing updates, and administration records across clinical care boundaries.

Medication tracking conveys orders, dispensing changes and administration information across care boundaries while keeping their meanings separate. This supports a coherent therapy account without treating a supplied medicine as an administered dose or a distributed order as treatment performed.</documentation>
