              <folder name="[Feature] Order Closed-Loop Progression Tracking" id="id-abfbdd8f59d14508a53accf2cacbb79a">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Order Closed-Loop Progression Tracking" id="id-157ff4007a5450beb816543f882416fa">
                  <documentation>Track order progression across destination determination, routing, delivery, receipt acknowledgement (distinguishing technical delivery acknowledgement from business acknowledgement), execution progress, completion, and outcome association.

Closed-loop tracking keeps delivery, technical acknowledgement, business disposition, execution and returned outcome distinct. Its purpose is to expose what has actually been established at each stage, preventing a successful handoff from being reported as eventual fulfilment.</documentation>
