              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Closed-Loop Order Progression" id="id-5f410811dfd950f0a195ba1f600b15f0">
                <documentation>Administer the traceable progression of an order from request through destination, delivery, acknowledgement, fulfilment and outcome association.

**Overview**

Administer the traceable progression of an order from request through destination, delivery, acknowledgement, fulfilment and outcome association. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer the traceable progression of an order from request through destination, delivery, acknowledgement, fulfilment and outcome association.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
