            <folder name="[CT3] Procedure &amp; Surgical Administration" id="id-3bba3ab2c5a340119ec4ad0d7825c7cf">
              <folder name="[Feature] Procedural Documentation Ingestion" id="id-a252350cf9d848e991fe1d05c276f3c1">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Procedural Documentation Ingestion" id="id-b2a05065d92758159716890b3d1a785c">
                  <documentation>Ingest operative reports, anesthesia records, and post-procedure summaries.

Procedural documentation ingestion preserves the operative, anaesthetic and post-procedure account supplied by the clinical service. It connects performed-care documentation with the wider record without giving the integration process authority to originate or judge the clinical findings.</documentation>
