              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Procedure &amp; Surgical Administration" id="id-afd1a07848325b678cdee592358efbb4">
                <documentation>Administer the established procedure &amp; surgical administration information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority.

**Overview**

Administer the established procedure &amp; surgical administration information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer the established procedure &amp; surgical administration information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
