          <folder name="[CT2] Referral Administration" id="id-7cea7e7b96694233a2f1faadd01a3418">
            <folder name="[CT3] Referral Intake &amp; Progression" id="id-2b969e84ebcf455e8b577a5c4ad6792e">
              <folder name="[Feature] Referral Destination Coordination" id="id-8be1ff5eb5c444ec8b3a389713c4d068">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Referral Destination Coordination" id="id-d977b0b1376453b9ba66d44eb556c0e9">
                  <documentation>Coordinate qualified referral destination resolution and convey the request under its applicable disposition contract.

**Overview**

Referral intake and status capture leave a distinct routing responsibility: finding the intended service and preserving redirection without turning technical delivery into assumed care responsibility.

**Boundary**

Does not make clinical triage decisions or infer Transfer of Care from acceptance.</documentation>
