              <folder name="[Feature] Referral Supporting Information" id="id-d39e368e1dcd442d80c15801cac7dbbf">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Referral Supporting Information" id="id-41682f56954051209563bf1a3b4af863">
                  <documentation>Collate and associate supporting clinical documentation, diagnostic history, and patient context with referral requests.

Supporting information gives the referral its relevant history and clinical context. Association makes the material available for the recipient's consideration while preserving source provenance and the distinction between evidence supplied and the recipient's own clinical decision.</documentation>
