              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Referral Intake &amp; Progression" id="id-f7fc7616aa89520a84e2235872dc93ed">
                <documentation>Receive and correlate referral requests, supporting information, destinations, disposition and progression through responsible care systems.

**Overview**

Receive and correlate referral requests, supporting information, destinations, disposition and progression through responsible care systems. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Receive and correlate referral requests, supporting information, destinations, disposition and progression through responsible care systems.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
