              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Appointment &amp; Booking Administration" id="id-75679799ab975e8088f69be6f0f414f0">
                <documentation>Administer externally supplied appointment and booking information and communicate changes in their scheduling status.

**Overview**

Administer externally supplied appointment and booking information and communicate changes in their scheduling status. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer externally supplied appointment and booking information and communicate changes in their scheduling status.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
