          <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Care Administration Enablement" id="id-fe7b5e3e02bb53f59ab89c27a81e9e18">
            <documentation>Administer the information and progression of care access, requests, encounters, records and plans across responsible care systems.

**Overview**

Administer the information and progression of care access, requests, encounters, records and plans across responsible care systems.

**Intent**

Administer the information and progression of care access, requests, encounters, records and plans across responsible care systems.

**Boundary**

Information administration does not perform the clinical act, own host booking engines or infer Transfer of Care from referral acceptance.</documentation>
