          <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Service Dependency Management" id="id-7afbcec0122951079c2bb647251be323">
            <documentation>Identify and track operational and infrastructure dependencies necessary for clinical services to function, including care-place and environmental readiness, devices, materiel, forms, workstations, connectivity, infrastructure and basic working materials.

**Overview**

Identify and track operational and infrastructure dependencies necessary for clinical services to function, including care-place and environmental readiness, devices, materiel, forms, workstations, connectivity, infrastructure and basic working materials. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Identify and track operational and infrastructure dependencies necessary for clinical services to function, including care-place and environmental readiness, devices, materiel, forms, workstations, connectivity, infrastructure and basic working materials.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
