              <folder name="[Feature] Consent Directive Evaluation" id="id-9ad563f0ccfb4c14b2432e98ab9b5965">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Consent Directive Evaluation" id="id-59c5db76c2d25e2d894cbaf05f986efb">
                  <documentation>Evaluate client consent directives against requested information disclosure and exchange actions.

Consent evaluation brings the client's applicable directives into consideration of a requested disclosure or exchange. It distinguishes the recorded directive from the particular action being evaluated, preserving the need for established policy and authority rather than treating consent data as a universal permission token.</documentation>
