              <folder name="[Feature] Relationship Validity Tracking" id="id-a71057239307498c9c34d11ca21c5a88">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Relationship Validity Tracking" id="id-f18e114c0b4b52f99c8e64d4a657d4b5">
                  <documentation>Maintain effective date intervals and authority scopes for nominated client relationships.

Relationship validity makes effective periods and authority scope part of the relationship's meaning. A contact association that was legitimate in one period or capacity need not be treated as currently valid for every purpose.</documentation>
