              <folder name="[Feature] Demographic Context Governance" id="id-4aebd1850d0c41c5ba4b7ea155679817">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Demographic Context Governance" id="id-c2745c3617f756d0b58bb1c5d0a8cb71">
                  <documentation>Manage essential demographic attributes (date of birth, sex, vital status) with full provenance and timestamping.

Demographic governance retains the provenance and temporal context of attributes used to interpret the subject of care. A changed date, status or demographic assertion can therefore be understood as sourced information rather than an unexplained overwrite of previously known context.</documentation>
