              <folder name="[Feature] Subject Context Binding" id="id-f82f3c9ee4e144a1b9bb04e3b4f6a1a7">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Subject Context Binding" id="id-3fec896b22ed53b99aa8437ae3245012">
                  <documentation>Bind authenticated person identity to clinical encounters, orders, and observations as the enduring subject of care with verifiable association.

Subject binding connects resolved identity with the records and activities concerning that person. It makes the association verifiable across encounters, orders and observations rather than assuming that proximity in a message or screen establishes the enduring subject of care.</documentation>
