              <folder name="[Feature] Governed Identity Correction" id="id-4a188459fd6c47db86965b1b32dcea57">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Governed Identity Correction" id="id-6f0bfe5e814c5734a7c530f2b7515666">
                  <documentation>Apply administrative identity updates, linked-record corrections, and split/merge notifications propagated from authoritative sources.

Governed correction applies externally authoritative identity updates and their consequences to Harmonia-managed associations. Administrative review concerns the legitimate application of the source outcome; it does not grant Harmonia an EMPI merge engine or authority to select a golden person record.</documentation>
