              <folder name="[Feature] Identifier Resolution" id="id-9fc70c16e35f47019d0d7a77c549d89b">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Identifier Resolution" id="id-f1e1928516765880955f638a7fec8c35">
                  <documentation>Ingest and resolve external identifiers against registered issuing authorities and namespace systems.

Identifier Resolution interprets an identifier in its issuing-authority and namespace context, so that the same local value is not assumed to identify the same person everywhere. It provides an identifiable subject reference without deciding an authoritative master-person match.</documentation>
