              <folder name="[Feature] Identity Source &amp; Correction Lineage" id="id-ff37b22dfbae4420a7971dee6375632f">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Identity Source &amp; Correction Lineage" id="id-bdf18b5e580b5b85a34357a3b21f36db">
                  <documentation>Retain source-attributed identity assertions and externally decided correction history.

**Overview**

Identifier correlations can change when an upstream authority corrects a relationship. Reviewers must be able to distinguish the source decision, its effective standing and the managed links affected.

**Boundary**

No probabilistic matching, golden-record selection or autonomous merge authority.</documentation>
