                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Device Serial Tracking" id="id-cf011e118aad5e158d838fa1c7f02e4b">
                  <documentation>Ingest and maintain unique device identifier (UDI) records and serial numbers.

Serial tracking makes individual hardware distinguishable within the device estate. A unique device reference supports subsequent assignment and source interpretation, while remaining separate from evidence that the device is maintained, connected or fit for a particular clinical use.</documentation>
