              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Device Profile Administration" id="id-66b395be368b5464932a1d028bac18a4">
                <documentation>Administer device type, instance, identifying and descriptive information needed to recognise clinical equipment and its stated capabilities.

**Overview**

Administer device type, instance, identifying and descriptive information needed to recognise clinical equipment and its stated capabilities.

**Intent**

Administer device type, instance, identifying and descriptive information needed to recognise clinical equipment and its stated capabilities.

**Boundary**

Describes device types and capabilities without taking regulatory approval or clinical-use authority.</documentation>
