            <folder name="[CT3] Device Connectivity Compliance Management" id="id-eda4126f485942cd9a935007bcfffb43">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Device Connectivity Compliance Management" id="id-ec5e54de56ea59dbb41c9ab6477ffea5">
                <documentation>Manage information about whether device connectivity satisfies applicable standards, policies and integration constraints.

**Overview**

Manage information about whether device connectivity satisfies applicable standards, policies and integration constraints. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage information about whether device connectivity satisfies applicable standards, policies and integration constraints.

**Boundary**

Endpoint registration alone does not establish compliance; conformity concerns applicable standards, policies and integration constraints.</documentation>
