              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Device OA&amp;M Metadata Management" id="id-c7a85b3afdcf5eca8beba6058ebd91e7">
                <documentation>Manage operational and administrative metadata needed to understand how a clinical device is connected, monitored and administered.

**Overview**

Manage operational and administrative metadata needed to understand how a clinical device is connected, monitored and administered. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage operational and administrative metadata needed to understand how a clinical device is connected, monitored and administered.

**Boundary**

Connectivity, monitoring and administration metadata do not perform device maintenance, interpret clinical telemetry or determine conformance.</documentation>
