              <folder name="[Feature] Device Association Lineage" id="id-234bd068d89341e2a4bb0eb03f61faea">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Device Association Lineage" id="id-d754effb7cca5cbea74d760acd8501cc">
                  <documentation>Preserve the attributed history and effective basis of device-to-subject/place associations.

**Overview**

A telemetry record needs to be interpreted against the association applicable when it arose, rather than the device current location alone.

**Boundary**

Association history does not interpret physiological observations or prove clinical correctness.</documentation>
