              <folder name="[Feature] Device-Patient/Location Assignment" id="id-724f396197e643388480a271d295a7d3">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Device-Patient/Location Assignment" id="id-773a1d80395252f492cecaced4054bf3">
                  <documentation>Track dynamic association between a telemetry monitor, patient, and physical bed.

Dynamic device association preserves which patient or physical place a device is linked to as assignments change. This is essential context for interpreting telemetry: a stable device identity does not imply that every observation concerns the same patient over time.</documentation>
