              <folder name="[Feature] Mobile Clinical Equipment Tracking" id="id-3175928b1e7742698bc07fffa732037b">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Mobile Clinical Equipment Tracking" id="id-a563f93c6b91563eb9fb0a16e8052144">
                  <documentation>Track physical location and allocation status of shared clinical equipment (infusion pumps, ventilators, mobile telemetry).

Equipment tracking provides the dynamic location and allocation context of shared devices. It distinguishes an identifiable asset from one available for the present operational need, while leaving maintenance, ownership and clinical authorisation with their respective responsibilities.</documentation>
