              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Device Utilisation Administration" id="id-09b56d7aca615938baee8103ee9ffb15">
                <documentation>Administer qualified device-to-subject/place allocation, location, utilisation and operational readiness information, including the time at which an association applies.

**Overview**

Administer qualified device-to-subject/place allocation, location, utilisation and operational readiness information, including the time at which an association applies. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer qualified device-to-subject/place allocation, location, utilisation and operational readiness information, including the time at which an association applies.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
