                <documentation>Administer batch/lot, serial, supplier, manufacturer, receipt/delivery and relevant movement/provenance information concerning health materiel.

**Overview**

Administer batch/lot, serial, supplier, manufacturer, receipt/delivery and relevant movement/provenance information concerning health materiel.

**Intent**

Administer batch/lot, serial, supplier, manufacturer, receipt/delivery and relevant movement/provenance information concerning health materiel.

**Boundary**

Materiel traceability does not make Harmonia a procurement, stock-control or supply-chain manager; specimen movement remains Clinical Logistics Coordination.</documentation>
