              <folder name="[Feature] Service Catalogue Publishing" id="id-659dff61adf84e618e1584edf747e881">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Service Catalogue Publishing" id="id-084705bec7aa5d6aa377c16fcdc8d05c">
                  <documentation>Publish structured healthcare service definitions, clinical specialties, and intake criteria to regional directories.

Service catalogue publishing makes identifiable service definitions and intake context available to regional participants. A published service can be discovered as an offering rather than inferred from an organisation's name; publication alone does not establish present availability or collective readiness.</documentation>
