              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Care-Place Definition Administration" id="id-6406fe2dfdf65a79980a8fbd6881f251">
                <documentation>Administer the stable description, characteristics and physical location of a bed, bay, chair or other care-place.

**Overview**

Administer the stable description, characteristics and physical location of a bed, bay, chair or other care-place.

**Intent**

Administer the stable description, characteristics and physical location of a bed, bay, chair or other care-place.

**Boundary**

Describes a place and its capabilities; operational bed state and readiness remain separately managed.</documentation>
