            <folder name="[CT3] Healthcare Location Profile Administration" id="id-d192f668f1514509b6694addf66b50e7">
              <folder name="[Feature] Location Geospatial &amp; Address Resolution" id="id-a6c1d09105c74aa5988767539b283e2a">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Location Geospatial &amp; Address Resolution" id="id-6df12096d1d752db9cd6211c5f51ea3a">
                  <documentation>Validate physical addresses, geospatial coordinates, and location operational status.

Address and geospatial resolution gives a recognised healthcare location an intelligible physical reference. It supports place interpretation without treating a valid address or recorded operating status as proof that a particular service or care place is currently ready.</documentation>
