              <folder name="[Feature] Directory Contact Management" id="id-7bc61f6d8ebd410bb2f242c5a9049fc2">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Directory Contact Management" id="id-15e478240fa95510833a12b9c6b0424a">
                  <documentation>Manage verified phone, email, and administrative contact channels for healthcare facilities.

Contact management provides verified administrative and clinical communication channels for organisations. It supports reaching the appropriate participant while distinguishing a directory contact from the role-specific destination and authority relevant to a particular clinical exchange.</documentation>
