              <folder name="[Feature] National Organisation Verification" id="id-57cd96163e7e40cda062fda7a9c5ac91">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="National Organisation Verification" id="id-cf983a3e0da35a50a06f2e8c3d7e5f2d">
                  <documentation>Validate national organization identifiers (e.g., HPI-O) and legal entity classifications.

National organisation verification grounds an organisation identifier and entity classification in their recognised context. This supports reliable interpretation of the healthcare participant without assuming that its identity establishes every service, location or authority associated with it.</documentation>
