                <documentation>Administer practitioner identity, professional profile and supplied registration information with its issuing-authority attribution.

**Overview**

Administer practitioner identity, professional profile and supplied registration information with its issuing-authority attribution.

**Intent**

Administer practitioner identity, professional profile and supplied registration information with its issuing-authority attribution.

**Boundary**

Professional registration and profile representation do not grant clinical or operational privilege.</documentation>
