              <folder name="[Feature] Practitioner-Organisation Affiliation" id="id-3bf98f40deb448109d35040a3492c884">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Practitioner-Organisation Affiliation" id="id-5199761c85d15e35bd4e6d9f00bf6e9d">
                  <documentation>Maintain temporal affiliations between practitioners and healthcare organizations.

Affiliation records keep practitioner participation in an organisation temporally intelligible. They support interpretation of an actor's organisational context while preserving that affiliation, employment, qualification and permission to undertake a particular activity answer different questions.</documentation>
