              <folder name="[Feature] Role &amp; Specialty Modeling" id="id-edb48923f85f4726a890d057620452f9">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Role &amp; Specialty Modeling" id="id-eab466ee0e1d5547b9e8a7461b4e1911">
                  <documentation>Define and associate clinical specialties, practice roles, and service capacities for a practitioner.

Role and specialty modelling describes the capacity in which a practitioner participates at an organisation or location. This keeps the person separate from each acting role and its service context; role resolution itself establishes neither Clinical Privilege nor Operational Privilege.</documentation>
