              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Practitioner Role Administration" id="id-394620b518475a49b9810a7f556b3313">
                <documentation>Administer practitioner roles, specialties, organisational affiliations, operational capacities and recognised role endpoints.

**Overview**

Administer practitioner roles, specialties, organisational affiliations, operational capacities and recognised role endpoints.

**Intent**

Administer practitioner roles, specialties, organisational affiliations, operational capacities and recognised role endpoints.

**Boundary**

Role, specialty, capacity and endpoint information supply context; they do not constitute a privilege determination.</documentation>
