            <folder name="[CT3] Vendor Liaison" id="id-4ed2a1dd7d4f48af8a551efec4e0da14">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Vendor Liaison" id="id-f65c91b69f5a54cfae47b3572ae8bb4e">
                <documentation>Maintain the information and liaison arrangements needed to interact with vendors supporting healthcare provision.

**Overview**

Maintain the information and liaison arrangements needed to interact with vendors supporting healthcare provision. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Maintain the information and liaison arrangements needed to interact with vendors supporting healthcare provision.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
