            <documentation>Administer identifying, descriptive and qualified relationship information concerning healthcare participants, organisations, locations, services, materiel and devices.

**Overview**

Administer identifying, descriptive and qualified relationship information concerning healthcare participants, organisations, locations, services, materiel and devices.

**Intent**

Administer identifying, descriptive and qualified relationship information concerning healthcare participants, organisations, locations, services, materiel and devices.

**Boundary**

Registry information does not establish clinical privilege, service readiness, occupancy or originating national identity authority.</documentation>
