              <documentation>Establish and provide governed information assets and reporting inputs for population-health purposes, including applicable notification obligations.

**Overview**

Establish and provide governed information assets and reporting inputs for population-health purposes, including applicable notification obligations.

**Intent**

Establish and provide governed information assets and reporting inputs for population-health purposes, including applicable notification obligations.

**Boundary**

Does not determine population-health findings, create statutory obligations or equate transport delivery with discharge of notification duty.</documentation>
