          <folder name="[CT2] Service Planning Data Management" id="id-02a40ac3e0ff454a954f84110be5563d">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Service Planning Data Management" id="id-95802b6c6b505351b4d3d57f8aed2753">
              <documentation>Establish and maintain governed information assets suitable for health-service planning, modelling and analysis.

**Overview**

Establish and maintain governed information assets suitable for health-service planning, modelling and analysis.

**Intent**

Establish and maintain governed information assets suitable for health-service planning, modelling and analysis.

**Boundary**

Observed utilisation, operational capacity and planned capacity are distinct; information provision does not commission services or allocate resources.</documentation>
