              <folder name="[Feature] Bed Availability Tracking" id="id-32cf1d1c29cf47359026d7a138a7bdda">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Bed Availability Tracking" id="id-37a284c316fd590991cc54279e766af4">
                  <documentation>Maintain operational status of all registered beds and care-places (VACANT, OCCUPIED, BLOCKED, RESERVED, DIRTY, CLEANING, CLEAN).

Availability tracking preserves the operational distinctions among vacancy, occupancy, reservation, blockage and cleaning conditions. These states support meaningful care-place coordination without equating an unoccupied bed with a ready place or usable service capacity.</documentation>
