            <folder name="[CT3] Session &amp; Queue Coordination" id="id-64145cf8f573477b81623889d0677a3b">
              <folder name="[Feature] Clinic Session Capacity Management" id="id-75b33d1c027543fc8d0460906bfa1a2f">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinic Session Capacity Management" id="id-a766049417a05c75815f7dc20c247bb3">
                  <documentation>Represent available, committed and utilised session capacity under clinic-specific constraints.

**Overview**

Clinic capacity depends on session staffing and service mix as well as places; queue progression alone is insufficient.

**Boundary**

Local responsibility retains its capacity meaning; Service Capacity Management consumes it without acquiring ownership or imposing one common capacity model.</documentation>
