              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Session &amp; Queue Coordination" id="id-5c2d8bf1b2ec5762b2be0bc402aa7ca1">
                <documentation>Coordinate clinic/practice session state, operational queue progression and context-specific session capacity information.

**Overview**

Coordinate clinic/practice session state, operational queue progression and context-specific session capacity information. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Coordinate clinic/practice session state, operational queue progression and context-specific session capacity information.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
