              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Specimen Movement Traceability" id="id-8c4d5090fb7150469d8e4b10a7551dab">
                <documentation>Maintain attributable pickup, custody, transport-condition and delivery traceability for clinical specimens.

**Overview**

Maintain attributable pickup, custody, transport-condition and delivery traceability for clinical specimens. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Maintain attributable pickup, custody, transport-condition and delivery traceability for clinical specimens.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
