              <folder name="[Feature] Operational Credential Check" id="id-76071d57fdc245af8f2a39e43ed0b48d">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Operational Credential Check" id="id-5ac299185f3957a4a8370bcbda042fca">
                  <documentation>Validate that a practitioner possesses active credentials and required competency certs prior to dispatching specialized work.

The qualification checkpoint considers active professional credentials and competency evidence before specialised dispatch. Its historical credential terminology does not make it the operational badge or physical-access responsibility of Credential Management, nor does a qualification check alone establish all required privilege.</documentation>
