              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Provider Clinical Qualification Tracking" id="id-7b77530f0c8a569498954dc0a5fcf798">
                <documentation>Track supplied provider clinical qualifications, competency certificates and privilege evidence with effective dates and issuing-authority standing.

**Overview**

Track supplied provider clinical qualifications, competency certificates and privilege evidence with effective dates and issuing-authority standing. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Track supplied provider clinical qualifications, competency certificates and privilege evidence with effective dates and issuing-authority standing.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
