              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Escalation Path Management" id="id-e77accf68d2a5f63b25c3c257d97feec">
                <documentation>Manage clinical escalation paths and their applicability, contacts and progression conditions for use by responsible clinical participants.

**Overview**

Manage clinical escalation paths and their applicability, contacts and progression conditions for use by responsible clinical participants. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage clinical escalation paths and their applicability, contacts and progression conditions for use by responsible clinical participants.

**Boundary**

Harmonia manages the escalation path; responsible clinical participants perform supervision and retain clinical judgement.</documentation>
