          <folder name="[CT2] Clinical Training &amp; Education" id="id-eec8d10ace0143629f0b3cf50a423d0d">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Training &amp; Education" id="id-e4265b53f55553c2acc4f7322e9f1cf2">
              <documentation>Clinical Training &amp; Education remains a Reference context for developing practitioners' knowledge and skills. The catalogue recognises its enterprise significance without assigning training delivery or a Feature decomposition to Harmonia. Its separation from qualification checks prevents a represented certificate or training record from being mistaken for the education activity itself.

**Overview**

Clinical Training &amp; Education remains a Reference context for developing practitioners' knowledge and skills. The catalogue recognises its enterprise significance without assigning training delivery or a Feature decomposition to Harmonia. Its separation from qualification checks prevents a represented certificate or training record from being mistaken for the education activity itself.

**Intent**

Clinical Training &amp; Education remains a Reference context for developing practitioners' knowledge and skills. The catalogue recognises its enterprise significance without assigning training delivery or a Feature decomposition to Harmonia. Its separation from qualification checks prevents a represented certificate or training record from being mistaken for the education activity itself.

**Boundary**

Information administration does not confer authority over the represented person, organisation, service, place, device or clinical activity.

---

## History

### Boundary — predecessor explanation

No platform training programme, assessment process or clinical teaching authority is established.

### Harmonia Architectural Relevance — predecessor explanation

Reference standing retains enterprise context without a material assigned processing responsibility in this entry.</documentation>
