          <folder name="[CT2] Credential Management" id="id-e1e0c0c2d1a4490c8fbdb73028d72868">
            <folder name="[CT3] Clinical Service Credential Definition Management" id="id-0ee1909cb5ad419e8c18a54d6aa632f1">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Service Credential Definition Management" id="id-69e67b8a2bb25dd99ec9fb966b9d5481">
                <documentation>Manage the definitions of credentials required for participation in a clinical service, distinct from physical badges and authentication credentials.

**Overview**

Manage the definitions of credentials required for participation in a clinical service, distinct from physical badges and authentication credentials. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage the definitions of credentials required for participation in a clinical service, distinct from physical badges and authentication credentials.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
