            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Credential Management" id="id-ecc5bfe7e27b54dfb59023a05879f1b0">
              <documentation>Administer definitions of clinical-service credentials and their required applicability without granting professional privilege or managing physical badges.

**Overview**

Administer definitions of clinical-service credentials and their required applicability without granting professional privilege or managing physical badges. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer definitions of clinical-service credentials and their required applicability without granting professional privilege or managing physical badges.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
