              <folder name="[Feature] Discharge Notification Dispatch" id="id-7e85fefb3d60419ba9bd7a7b7465682e">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Discharge Notification Dispatch" id="id-5dcf4908977755da9d9d24634c06a74e">
                  <documentation>Dispatch departure notifications, updated bed states, and finalized discharge summaries to external care providers upon physical patient exit.

Departure notification communicates the physical exit and associated record and place-state context to the applicable participants. It distinguishes departure information from earlier readiness and from the clinical decision, while retaining the separate question of responsibility actually assumed elsewhere.</documentation>
