              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Discharge Progression &amp; Coordination" id="id-a99640e4d2c05ac3be8b58e113e550dc">
                <documentation>Coordinate externally established discharge milestones, multidisciplinary readiness information and departure notifications.

**Overview**

Coordinate externally established discharge milestones, multidisciplinary readiness information and departure notifications. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Coordinate externally established discharge milestones, multidisciplinary readiness information and departure notifications.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
