                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Emergency Department Arrival &amp; Triage Ingestion" id="id-79aecd702d2b5dcfb35db553f01bf0d1">
                  <documentation>Ingest emergency presentation, triage category, and chief complaint records.

