              <folder name="[Feature] ED Length of Stay Tracking" id="id-220e8776c60740c6a95ff77bb206f689">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="ED Length of Stay Tracking" id="id-39515750d91154fd8d37227f3bae2ae5">
                  <documentation>Monitor operational wait times and length-of-stay milestones, generating operational escalation notifications.

Length-of-stay tracking makes waits and operational timing thresholds visible for escalation. The timing information supports management of impediments without determining clinical urgency or making an elapsed-time alert an independent assurance finding.</documentation>
