              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Emergency Department Operational Coordination" id="id-1b8e6ac4079f5e8dad95cae8bbb52aaf">
                <documentation>Coordinate emergency-department bed/bay occupancy, operational waits, length-of-stay milestones and local capacity information.

**Overview**

Coordinate emergency-department bed/bay occupancy, operational waits, length-of-stay milestones and local capacity information. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Coordinate emergency-department bed/bay occupancy, operational waits, length-of-stay milestones and local capacity information.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
