          <folder name="[CT2] Mobile Staff Management" id="id-fe4c90ee6a27485d887e0aec1b5e1eaf">
            <folder name="[CT3] Mobile Worker Dispatch &amp; Safety Coordination" id="id-3742f728d61b4f8f8d870d144a7bd1c8">
              <folder name="[Feature] Mobile Service Capacity Management" id="id-b875443330404d91bb8629bd7062b1ea">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Mobile Service Capacity Management" id="id-56e5d0861bcd5ac2a6bf3e2206be9623">
                  <documentation>Represent mobile service capacity with travel, coverage, work commitment and availability context.

**Overview**

Mobile availability cannot be interpreted as a simple on-duty count because distance, assignments and suitable skills affect deliverability.

**Boundary**

Local responsibility retains its capacity meaning; Service Capacity Management consumes it without acquiring ownership or imposing one common capacity model.</documentation>
