              <folder name="[Feature] Mobile Worker Task Dispatch" id="id-40ef262338614fde8775cade661430b4">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Mobile Worker Task Dispatch" id="id-2bc2b73b45f85084a790267351edc65b">
                  <documentation>Dispatch community care tasks and urgent visits to roving clinicians' mobile devices.

Mobile dispatch exchanges externally established assignment, dispatch and progression information with business mobile-work mechanisms. The retained name does not grant Harmonia authority to allocate clinical work, manage handover or own EMR worklists, and external task terminology does not redefine Synthetic Task.

**Boundary**

The proposed replacement name remains unconfirmed. This entry preserves the existing identity and the human-adjudicated integration boundary.</documentation>
