              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Mobile Worker Dispatch &amp; Safety Coordination" id="id-3fd840ab23015c128060f2b3dd4359b4">
                <documentation>Exchange externally established mobile work assignments, visit progression and safety check-in information with qualified worker context.

**Overview**

Exchange externally established mobile work assignments, visit progression and safety check-in information with qualified worker context. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Exchange externally established mobile work assignments, visit progression and safety check-in information with qualified worker context.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
