              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="On-Call Availability &amp; Contact Resolution" id="id-c3f38627d9395f77bf64711330c8f290">
                <documentation>Resolve currently available on-call providers and their contact paths for the applicable specialty, service and time.

**Overview**

Resolve currently available on-call providers and their contact paths for the applicable specialty, service and time. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Resolve currently available on-call providers and their contact paths for the applicable specialty, service and time.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
