              <folder name="[Feature] Post-Clinic Order Coordination" id="id-67912876dfc842e6be23af9e11d92827">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Post-Clinic Order Coordination" id="id-6d8246a51c6a534cbf9d036ad6b88a08">
                  <documentation>Capture follow-up booking and diagnostic order requirements generated at clinic completion.

Post-clinic coordination captures the follow-up bookings and diagnostic requirements established at clinic completion. It connects those requirements with subsequent operational activity while preserving that capture is not the clinical decision, a completed booking or diagnostic fulfilment.</documentation>
