              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Outpatient Flow Coordination" id="id-4595d9da485357d4b4d5ab830b5ad0a1">
                <documentation>Coordinate outpatient arrival, clinic flow, follow-up requirements and context-specific outpatient capacity information.

**Overview**

Coordinate outpatient arrival, clinic flow, follow-up requirements and context-specific outpatient capacity information. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Coordinate outpatient arrival, clinic flow, follow-up requirements and context-specific outpatient capacity information.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
