              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Patient Transfer Coordination" id="id-c67d028a12d457b1bff85ea82df63718">
                <documentation>Coordinate patient transport requests, dispatch and observed departure, transit and arrival milestones.

**Overview**

Coordinate patient transport requests, dispatch and observed departure, transit and arrival milestones. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Coordinate patient transport requests, dispatch and observed departure, transit and arrival milestones.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
