              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Service Demand &amp; Capacity Coordination" id="id-4125661f05bc5551a63787e0afe15491">
                <documentation>Coordinate demand and capacity information across services while retaining the originating responsibilities of context-specific capacity providers.

**Overview**

Coordinate demand and capacity information across services while retaining the originating responsibilities of context-specific capacity providers. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Coordinate demand and capacity information across services while retaining the originating responsibilities of context-specific capacity providers.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
