          <folder name="[CT2] Service Establishment Support" id="id-e77d69d7b38440ebafe45de41d970d22">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Service Establishment Support" id="id-1ae0ff5d6b3b54deb3f9a0832045bcf5">
              <documentation>Support the information needed to establish a health service in its intended operating context.

**Overview**

Support the information needed to establish a health service in its intended operating context. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Support the information needed to establish a health service in its intended operating context.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
