              <folder name="[Feature] Theatre Session Capacity Management" id="id-f6867e4651ca4acfbfb0b1bfd888a8c6">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Theatre Session Capacity Management" id="id-2047568070c354a381514a23e44cd763">
                  <documentation>Represent available and committed procedural-session capacity with its resource dependencies.

**Overview**

Theatre capacity involves session time, team capability, equipment and recovery provision rather than a count of theatres.

**Boundary**

Local responsibility retains its capacity meaning; Service Capacity Management consumes it without acquiring ownership or imposing one common capacity model.</documentation>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="proposal:feature-theatre-session-capacity-management"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="HCM-FT-theatre-session-capacity-management"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / LaTeX Label" value="feature:theatre-session-capacity-management"/>
