                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Inpatient Clinical Progression Tracking" id="id-de2b013d1c5b559297a47c8e839bf849">
                  <documentation>Capture inpatient clinical milestone completions (e.g., medical stability achieved, allied health clearance).

Inpatient progression tracking captures clinical milestones reported by the responsible participants. General clinical-information capabilities and configured workflow composition suffice for the established Feature; capture does not require inventing a specialised Function or make Harmonia the authority declaring clinical stability.</documentation>
