              <folder name="[Feature] Inpatient Rounding Context Provision" id="id-b90fcd9245304aa99b97f103c3156074">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Inpatient Rounding Context Provision" id="id-317d264de57158c7abd59b04b424f8c2">
                  <documentation>Aggregate diagnostic results, current medication administration records, and nursing notes for multidisciplinary inpatient rounds.

Rounding context brings results, medication records and nursing notes into an accessible multidisciplinary view. Assembly serves the clinical discussion but does not perform rounds, determine pending clinical work or establish the team's professional conclusions.</documentation>
