              <folder name="[Feature] Ward Care Capacity Management" id="id-05627f91b3ed4d7a8268cf0a492fec67">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Ward Care Capacity Management" id="id-93de013fe0b75f5cbaf7a4275539eb93">
                  <documentation>Represent ward care capacity in relation to staffing, care-place suitability and patient dependency.

**Overview**

A clean bed can remain unusable when staffing or patient needs constrain the ward; source clinical facts remain attributed.

**Boundary**

Local responsibility retains its capacity meaning; Service Capacity Management consumes it without acquiring ownership or imposing one common capacity model.</documentation>
