              <folder name="[Feature] Ward Patient Flow Coordination" id="id-56e5dbb613214d99b8cb4996eb52b847">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Ward Patient Flow Coordination" id="id-6ff20df32f225115adaf5651c8bc20ce">
                  <documentation>Coordinate inpatient ward occupancy, care-place allocation, and patient bed status across care facilities.

Ward flow coordination connects occupancy, place allocation and bed status within the ward's operational context. Those facts contribute to ward capacity but do not exhaust its acuity, staffing and cohorting responsibilities or prove that another patient can be accepted.</documentation>
