              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Ward Logistics Coordination" id="id-5d528e4fcb5e5092a26ac5fba62d8fe9">
                <documentation>Coordinate ward patient flow, handover context and ward-specific operational logistics and capacity information.

**Overview**

Coordinate ward patient flow, handover context and ward-specific operational logistics and capacity information. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Coordinate ward patient flow, handover context and ward-specific operational logistics and capacity information.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
