              <folder name="[Feature] Work Item Instantiation" id="id-2555e6908bad4b5f80aad80787c54f1c">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Work Item Instantiation" id="id-f63d1e9808aa5ac78f8aab1e05fbb7d0">
                  <documentation>Instantiate operational units of work from clinical triggers (e.g., bed cleaning required, specimen transport required).

Work-item instantiation gives an authorised operational requirement an identifiable unit of work. It distinguishes recognising that support activity is needed from assigning it, dispatching it and recording its completion; a clinical trigger does not make the resulting support item clinical work authority.</documentation>
