              <folder name="[Feature] Work Progress Oversight &amp; Escalation" id="id-2e9475f4c7bc4db3a7b6907b168e5ae2">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Work Progress Oversight &amp; Escalation" id="id-8b77c87dc8ba58d8b154ef1927270e04">
                  <documentation>Monitor work progression against time-to-completion thresholds, escalating stalled or unacknowledged tasks.

Progress oversight identifies stalled or unacknowledged operational work against applicable timing expectations. Escalation serves completion management and does not itself constitute independent assurance or transfer authority over clinical decisions related to the support activity.</documentation>
