            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Assurance Service Review" id="id-8a7d47abbe015a309139a0ee2c1250d4">
              <documentation>Independently review the operation, effectiveness, appropriateness and conformance of the assurance service itself.

**Overview**

Independently review the operation, effectiveness, appropriateness and conformance of the assurance service itself. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Independently review the operation, effectiveness, appropriateness and conformance of the assurance service itself.

**Boundary**

Reviews the assurance service itself. Canonical evidence association, subject assessment, adjudication, findings and conclusions are retained separately pending adjudication.</documentation>
