            <folder name="[CT3] Assurance Design" id="id-f037a2c00e3944f4aebc45d254253d86">
              <folder name="[Feature] Assurance Disposition &amp; Design Modelling" id="id-c1aa5354fb4f469daceec938aa78f1a0">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Assurance Disposition &amp; Design Modelling" id="id-fd8f8171bd2b50e5a5b3b916cbb1d89a">
                  <documentation>Model how satisfaction of an applicable governed concern will be independently established.

**Overview**

This proposal provides a Feature frame for the established design responsibility, including disposition, criteria and evidence expectations, without creating an additional assurance Function.

**Boundary**

Modelling is distinct from requirement approval, subject management and evaluation.</documentation>
