                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Schedule Projection Integration" id="id-aea0b75e918a5827b541770aa620a6f8">
                  <documentation>Project clinician rosters, on-call schedules, and facility operating calendars into operational views.

Schedule projection makes external roster, on-call and facility calendars available in operational views. It preserves their temporal usefulness without making the projection the authoritative schedule or granting authority to alter staffing and coverage decisions.</documentation>
