              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Operational &amp; Clinical Calendar Coordination" id="id-d975937d894d521eaf2465cf00b08aaf">
                <documentation>Coordinate projections of operational and clinical calendars and correlate temporal events without taking ownership of source bookings or rosters.

**Overview**

Coordinate projections of operational and clinical calendars and correlate temporal events without taking ownership of source bookings or rosters. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Coordinate projections of operational and clinical calendars and correlate temporal events without taking ownership of source bookings or rosters.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
