              <folder name="[Feature] In-Conversation LHR Query Resolution" id="id-dff333cbb0f64d1fb77cc4fdd2ca5739">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="In-Conversation LHR Query Resolution" id="id-07ba91e1f3105439b697ef7dbce26f82">
                  <documentation>Resolve clinical data queries within an authorized collaboration context, presenting verified clinical summaries directly to care team members.

In-conversation query supplies governed clinical summaries within an authorised collaboration context. The convenience of retrieving information during discussion does not weaken consent or access controls, and displaying a summary does not promote the surrounding conversation into the clinical record.</documentation>
