              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Context Collaboration" id="id-97b0afca9c9e513d8205eb624be06169">
                <documentation>Enable governed multidisciplinary collaboration with clinical context while preserving the distinction between discourse and authored clinical records.

**Overview**

Enable governed multidisciplinary collaboration with clinical context while preserving the distinction between discourse and authored clinical records. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Enable governed multidisciplinary collaboration with clinical context while preserving the distinction between discourse and authored clinical records.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
