          <folder name="[CT2] Clinical Knowledge Services" id="id-1f5344f0268c4e15bc75693851d9903d">
            <folder name="[CT3] Clinical Knowledge Artefact Distribution Management" id="id-47e0c0cb43074a519627e663187ae7e7">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Knowledge Artefact Distribution Management" id="id-048fd66ba8095ee3bb759b0c89bdf32f">
                <documentation>Manage distribution of governed clinical knowledge artefacts to intended consumers under their applicable use contracts.

**Overview**

Manage distribution of governed clinical knowledge artefacts to intended consumers under their applicable use contracts. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage distribution of governed clinical knowledge artefacts to intended consumers under their applicable use contracts.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
