            <folder name="[CT3] Clinical Knowledge Request Administration" id="id-86ea731a21094774b68d38b312fd5213">
              <folder name="[Feature] Bidirectional Terminology Mapping" id="id-48a41f91640b4d16816ba108e0c1e161">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Bidirectional Terminology Mapping" id="id-1116384ed5cc5bd3a0d28aa12a00d5cc">
                  <documentation>Translate between legacy local code systems and canonical national healthcare profiles.

Terminology mapping applies governed correspondence between local and canonical semantic systems. Translation preserves the limitations and authority of the map; it does not justify silently treating related source concepts as identical or clinically adjudicating the underlying information.</documentation>
