              <folder name="[Feature] Clinical Concept Resolution" id="id-0452bffde73d40c7ae2d9863600a874d">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Clinical Concept Resolution" id="id-e97a4d5858585c9a89e93fb9321aba7c">
                  <documentation>Resolve local clinical codes against standard terminologies (SNOMED CT, LOINC, ICD-10).

Concept resolution makes a coded clinical reference interpretable against its governed terminology. It validates the reference context without making a recognised code proof of clinical truth or giving the consuming system authority to redefine the concept.</documentation>
