            <folder name="[CT3] Governed Reference Dataset Administration" id="id-abdd4c73fc82442eaddc27ce36af68d4">
              <folder name="[Feature] Governed Dataset Content Revision" id="id-a6fe3eedca2b4f6cb2e08410127c06ec">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Governed Dataset Content Revision" id="id-a41954fb90ab5744a24d14428d45c29a">
                  <documentation>Review, accept and expose authorised changes to mutable reference content with effective revision standing.

**Overview**

A model definition can remain stable while approved terminology membership or mapping content changes. This Feature represents that operational governance without making every definition runtime mutable.

**Boundary**

Does not invent an approval authority or bypass normal durable establishment.</documentation>
