              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Governed Reference Dataset Administration" id="id-cc4edaeee1d3519185ee94a683e4a5e0">
                <documentation>Administer approved runtime reference-dataset content and revisions separately from the reusable models defining its meaning.

**Overview**

Administer approved runtime reference-dataset content and revisions separately from the reusable models defining its meaning.

**Intent**

Administer approved runtime reference-dataset content and revisions separately from the reusable models defining its meaning.

**Boundary**

Does not own external ontology authority, execute authorisation policy or establish durable truth independently of the normal persistence boundary.</documentation>
