                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Operational Team Chat Enablement" id="id-47a6974fa53d5efdb0ec6a3f36f31d1c">
                  <documentation>Provide secure instant messaging channels for departmental, administrative, and facility support staff.

Operational chat provides secure communication for administrative and support teams. It enables participants to discuss work while leaving assignment, completion and the authority of operational decisions with the capabilities responsible for that activity.</documentation>
