              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Operational Collaboration" id="id-7a89497d659f50629cd7dd7105c0e411">
                <documentation>Enable operational team discussion and collaboration without promoting conversational content to clinical record authority.

**Overview**

Enable operational team discussion and collaboration without promoting conversational content to clinical record authority. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Enable operational team discussion and collaboration without promoting conversational content to clinical record authority.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
