              <folder name="[Feature] Access-Controlled Information Filtering" id="id-4617549e60614d49b5f008cf78727d01">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Access-Controlled Information Filtering" id="id-05263c5deb1d5ddfb4cbca4fad307bbd">
                  <documentation>Filter search results dynamically according to requesting user authorizations and patient consent directives.

Access-qualified filtering restricts the disclosed result to the verified caller's authority and applicable consent. The responsibility is more specific than retrieving a resource; the latter's shared owner and subject matter do not establish a Feature realisation relationship.</documentation>
