              <folder name="[Feature] Federated Clinical Query" id="id-b7ba6f0ccdfb471b942e5dfdf07417f7">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Federated Clinical Query" id="id-7750de806a73576bba5905eebbc9d550">
                  <documentation>Execute bounded, indexed queries across distributed clinical resources and directory graphs.

Federated query makes relevant clinical and directory information discoverable across distributed contexts using bounded criteria. Discovery is a governed information-access responsibility rather than authority to disclose every match or reinterpret the clinical meaning of the results.</documentation>
