              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Governed Health Information Retrieval" id="id-2b06d69a6fe75ab79dc8d11abe5c780a">
                <documentation>Retrieve and search health information and apply access-qualified result filtering under established access and consent determinations.

**Overview**

Retrieve and search health information and apply access-qualified result filtering under established access and consent determinations. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Retrieve and search health information and apply access-qualified result filtering under established access and consent determinations.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
