            <folder name="[CT3] HIE Implementation Management" id="id-4ba3cb16786f496a819b0de8491572bd">
              <folder name="[Feature] Addressed Clinical Distribution" id="id-b3b9a7b151ba42c48b2e0d39cb65d343">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Addressed Clinical Distribution" id="id-58f6fa48f0e35e7dab2554c31ac16497">
                  <documentation>Fan out clinical events and diagnostic reports to designated external and internal recipients with per-destination delivery tracking.

Addressed distribution sends information to explicitly designated recipients and tracks each destination's delivery separately. This preserves partial outcomes in a fan-out rather than collapsing several deliveries into a single success that hides a missing recipient.</documentation>
