              <folder name="[Feature] Direct Submission Ingestion &amp; Delivery" id="id-cd150593dfb74e06a573ba23f564d34e">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Direct Submission Ingestion &amp; Delivery" id="id-faf9309586445b52ad791069de388e1a">
                  <documentation>Support push submissions of clinical documents and messages across boundaries.

Direct submission supports a sender's deliberate push of information across an exchange boundary. It preserves the distinction between ingress or delivery acceptance and the recipient's business handling, under the actual contract rather than an assumed meaning of transport success.</documentation>
