              <folder name="[Feature] Event-Driven Syndication" id="id-446fead2a9784edf8fcad46ac5ae1237">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Event-Driven Syndication" id="id-800daf9a3a695e5ab10e449abc4b96bc">
                  <documentation>Publish clinical and directory change events to subscribed systems matching interest filters.

Syndication connects published changes with subscribers whose registered interests match them. It differs from named-recipient distribution in how consumers are selected, while retaining governed delivery and the distinction between notification and the subscriber's eventual business action.</documentation>
