              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="HIE Implementation Management" id="id-390fb11c89e7528e96684afcec04539a">
                <documentation>Manage implementation information and progression for established exchange requirements, including submission, retrieval, distribution and syndication interactions.

**Overview**

Manage implementation information and progression for established exchange requirements, including submission, retrieval, distribution and syndication interactions. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage implementation information and progression for established exchange requirements, including submission, retrieval, distribution and syndication interactions.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
