            <folder name="[CT3] HIE Requirement Management" id="id-eccc143288f44b45930d75e943150ea8">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="HIE Requirement Management" id="id-7c8885a8c55552888e8b3cda35c06693">
                <documentation>Manage the identified information-exchange requirements, interaction contracts and participant obligations applicable to a health-information exchange.

**Overview**

Manage the identified information-exchange requirements, interaction contracts and participant obligations applicable to a health-information exchange. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage the identified information-exchange requirements, interaction contracts and participant obligations applicable to a health-information exchange.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
