ty owns exchange transaction state without acquiring clinical-document ownership. Its name collision with the BC remains unresolved; exchange egress ends management of the emitted representation.&quot;,&quot;Capability Overview&quot;:&quot;As a BEC, Health Information Exchange provides reusable information-movement enablement through submission, retrieval mediation, addressed distribution and syndication. The models distinguish sending to a participant, requesting information, deliberately distributing to named recipients and publishing changes to matching subscribers. Their common responsibility is the exchange context, including routing and delivery state, rather than the business meaning of every payload.&quot;,&quot;Harmonia Architectural Relevance&quot;:&quot;Multi-party exchange and per-destination delivery tracking are substantive Core responsibilities, bounded by the external contract and originating information authority.&quot;},&quot;baseline_placement&quot;:{&quot;canonical_id&quot;:null,&quot;owner_key&quot;:null,&quot;parent_key&quot;:null,&quot;tier&quot;:null},&quot;baseline_unresolved&quot;:[&quot;tier&quot;,&quot;root_status&quot;,&quot;ancestry&quot;,&quot;canonical_id&quot;,&quot;code_allocation&quot;,&quot;name_uniqueness&quot;],&quot;baseline_version&quot;:&quot;0.1&quot;,&quot;canonical_id&quot;:&quot;CT1-BEC-GOVERNED-HEALTH-INFORMATION-ENABLEMENT.CT2-BEC-HEALTH-INFORMATION-CONNECTIVITY-ENABLEMENT.CT3-BEC-HEALTH-INFORMATION-EXCHANGE-ENABLEMENT&quot;,&quot;canonical_name&quot;:&quot;Health Information Exchange&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;business_enabling&quot;,&quot;confidence&quot;:&quot;High&quot;,&quot;governed_definition_latex&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;id_aliases&quot;:[],&quot;key&quot;:&quot;capability:health-information-exchange&quot;,&quot;latex_label&quot;:&quot;cap:bec-health-information-exchange&quot;,&quot;local_id&quot;:&quot;BEC-HEALTH-INFORMATION-EXCHANGE-ENABLEMENT&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Health Information Exchange Enablement&quot;,&quot;name_aliases&quot;:[&quot;Health Information Exchange&quot;],&quot;name_status&quot;:&quot;Proposed&quot;,&quot;naming_rationale&quot;:&quot;Distinguishes reusable Harmonia exchange enablement from the organisational BC of the same governed name; identity and responsibility remain Canonical.&quot;,&quot;owner_identifier&quot;:null,&quot;owner_key&quot;:null,&quot;parent_identifier&quot;:&quot;HCM-BEC-health-information-connectivity-enablement&quot;,&quot;parent_key&quot;:&quot;proposal:bec-health-information-connectivity-enablement&quot;,&quot;placement_provenance&quot;:{&quot;authority&quot;:&quot;Proposed only; cited source standing is not inherited&quot;,&quot;derivation&quot;:&quot;Responsibility-preserving proposed decomposition&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[{&quot;line&quot;:49,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/metamodel/business-architecture-metamodel.md&quot;,&quot;standing&quot;:&quot;Current corpus evidence; does not promote the derived assertion&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Harmonia SHALL use the fixed three-tier Capability decomposition:&quot;},{&quot;line&quot;:668,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;docs/markdown/governance/architectural-axioms.md&quot;,&quot;standing&quot;:&quot;Current corpus evidence; does not promote the derived assertion&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;### AX-14 — Semantic Distinctions Are Preserved&quot;}],&quot;method&quot;:&quot;AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task&quot;},&quot;placement_rationale&quot;:&quot;The responsibility concerns make governed health information discoverable and exchangeable under explicit internal and external contracts. It is the finest capability frame required for the established behaviour; the older contextual heading is not another capability tier.&quot;,&quot;placement_status&quot;:&quot;Proposed&quot;,&quot;reference_id&quot;:&quot;HCM-BEC-health-information-exchange&quot;,&quot;relevance&quot;:&quot;Harmonia-Core&quot;,&quot;respons