                <documentation>Manage attributable tags describing information assets without treating caller-controlled tags as security authority.

**Overview**

Manage attributable tags describing information assets without treating caller-controlled tags as security authority. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage attributable tags describing information assets without treating caller-controlled tags as security authority.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
