            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Information Asset Stewardship Management" id="id-0e93a43b398a503d804b87204f939a09">
              <documentation>Manage definitions and tags that make governed information assets recognisable and interpretable for their permitted uses.

**Overview**

Manage definitions and tags that make governed information assets recognisable and interpretable for their permitted uses. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage definitions and tags that make governed information assets recognisable and interpretable for their permitted uses.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
