                  <documentation>Record meaningful source-to-derived information relationships and transformation attribution.

**Overview**

A consumer should be able to explain which source assertions contributed to a managed representation and what significant transformation occurred.

**Boundary**

Routine cache reconstruction, retries and diagnostics do not automatically become permanent lineage.</documentation>
