            <folder name="[CT3] Information Product Administration" id="id-13a71766ff8b4daf80ee0e72d7fe4fdf">
              <folder name="[Feature] Authorised Research Release Assembly" id="id-0053f1b80a5e43f19ebe02edc85baeb0">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Authorised Research Release Assembly" id="id-91835e68ae02530786223c71a4acaa39">
                  <documentation>Assemble and qualify the existing information allowed by a particular authorised research purpose.

**Overview**

The release carries purpose and applicable privacy/consent/use constraints; the requester does not gain unrestricted clinical-record access by having a research role.

**Boundary**

No ethics approval, de-identification guarantee or clinical-trial management is inferred.</documentation>
