              <folder name="[Feature] Demand &amp; Capacity Planning Projection" id="id-df94c368fccf41b5a5f5d97d2ff87585">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Demand &amp; Capacity Planning Projection" id="id-1bd07e714962537590dc80ad2f2c7acd">
                  <documentation>Project qualified observed demand, capacity and utilisation for authorised planning consumers.

**Overview**

Comparisons need service, temporal and context qualifiers so that planned future capacity is not confused with present operational capacity.

**Boundary**

Projection does not establish a planning conclusion or allocate services and staff.</documentation>
