              <folder name="[Feature] Population Notification Obligation Tracking" id="id-b399dd061c5c498eba50577c455367e1">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Population Notification Obligation Tracking" id="id-b4ddb18a42815f51909df742fbb3f753">
                  <documentation>Track the relation between an applicable notification obligation, the supplied source evidence and observed notification disposition.

**Overview**

Sending a required notification and discharging the governing obligation are different assertions. This Feature keeps the explicit contract and indeterminate responses visible.

**Boundary**

Does not define notifiability, author statutory rules or own public-health response.</documentation>
