              <folder name="[Feature] Exchange Profile Governance" id="id-7b0166d913404c74973c5a4ff118170a">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Exchange Profile Governance" id="id-2541fb40968a5bf4b307b0c83bd8202b">
                  <documentation>Govern the semantic and conformance constraints of an interoperability profile.

**Overview**

An external contract must state which representations and extensions are permitted; validation applies that contract but does not define it.

**Boundary**

Profile governance does not transmit messages or publish internal operational metadata.</documentation>
