              <folder name="[Feature] Information Definition &amp; Schema Governance" id="id-c1a93c6440864d26b7dea2b8af22281d">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Information Definition &amp; Schema Governance" id="id-087c246587f15ff0b9554654eb508fd2">
                  <documentation>Govern structural definitions, data dictionaries and constraint meaning.

**Overview**

Existing definition-governance behaviour needs a distinct Feature frame from general semantic-model authorship and runtime validation.

**Boundary**

Governed definitions do not own runtime instances or their clinical facts.</documentation>
