              <folder name="[Feature] Information Standards &amp; Semantic Governance" id="id-bc787320a6574510acb2e96072441938">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Information Standards &amp; Semantic Governance" id="id-40a0a237e02e58769e19d6c4f13cdf8d">
                  <documentation>Govern canonical clinical data definitions, terminology bindings, and exchange profiles across regional systems.

Semantic governance provides canonical definitions, bindings and profiles through which regional representations can be understood consistently. Its purpose concerns meaning and constraints rather than a particular schema technology, and consuming a definition does not transfer its governing authority.</documentation>
