              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Enterprise Canonical/Reusable Model Design" id="id-cd6d12693e255af7876c44caddfdbdb4">
                <documentation>Design canonical and reusable enterprise information models and semantic bindings under applicable information-design governance.

**Overview**

Design canonical and reusable enterprise information models and semantic bindings under applicable information-design governance. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Design canonical and reusable enterprise information models and semantic bindings under applicable information-design governance.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
