              <folder name="[Feature] Semantic Conformance Verification" id="id-296fb3bb968242a48e4df0024e15038b">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Semantic Conformance Verification" id="id-4d0ca08bf6b4510c8171c5bd2e4e62f7">
                  <documentation>Verify inbound and outbound representations against published semantic rules and conformance constraints.

Conformance verification evaluates a representation against published semantic rules and constraints. It distinguishes meaningful conformity from simple parseability while retaining that a conformant message is not necessarily clinically true, authoritative or permitted for disclosure.</documentation>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="feature:semantic-conformance-verification"/>
