              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Enterprise Canonical/Reusable Model Utilisation Support" id="id-bb43c048f11e5d069f844bdb8c3a1ed9">
                <documentation>Support correct utilisation and conformance of canonical and reusable models across their intended consumers.

**Overview**

Support correct utilisation and conformance of canonical and reusable models across their intended consumers. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Support correct utilisation and conformance of canonical and reusable models across their intended consumers.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
