              <folder name="[Feature] Active Clinical Record Access" id="id-90366587d7be463eaf8c727113e4eb12">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Active Clinical Record Access" id="id-bfcb6625f31c552abf47156256316200">
                  <documentation>Provide low-latency, active distributed access to consolidated patient clinical summaries.

Active access supports responsive use of consolidated clinical summaries in ongoing care. The working representation remains reconstructable active state; speed and availability do not promote it to authoritative durable truth when persistence or convergence is unavailable.</documentation>
