              <folder name="[Feature] Longitudinal Health Record (LHR) Assembly" id="id-b190a9c80c6546aa91d822c01bb852a6">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Longitudinal Health Record (LHR) Assembly" id="id-1b6407fd4129511ab1134a5156efa49a">
                  <documentation>Assemble disparate encounters, diagnostic reports, medications, and clinical documents into a unified, vendor-neutral longitudinal timeline.

Longitudinal assembly relates contributions from disparate systems into a usable chronology. The unified view preserves source and subject context rather than turning consolidation into originating clinical authority or erasing differences in the standing of individual assertions.</documentation>
