              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Longitudinal Clinical Record Administration" id="id-dbb8a6f722f756808d5022cbd06aec85">
                <documentation>Administer longitudinal record assembly, active clinical summaries and durable received/managed history with source attribution and supersession.

**Overview**

Administer longitudinal record assembly, active clinical summaries and durable received/managed history with source attribution and supersession. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer longitudinal record assembly, active clinical summaries and durable received/managed history with source attribution and supersession.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
