              <folder name="[Feature] Primary Care Notification Dispatch" id="id-2b8e6529f7334751bef53041a4401825">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Primary Care Notification Dispatch" id="id-3c947d3531ae559bae7c358d9662ee7b">
                  <documentation>Dispatch emergency department arrival, acute admission, and discharge notifications to the patient's registered general practitioner.

Primary-care notifications inform the registered GP of significant acute-care events. This outward notification responsibility is distinct from querying a chronic-care timeline: the latter shares context but has no established equivalence to dispatching the required arrival, admission or discharge notice.</documentation>
