                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Longitudinal Clinical &amp; Operational Presentation" id="id-13fa0d57229b5a61be2d49730b4872ad">
                  <documentation>Deliver contextual clinical timelines, directory administration views, and operational management dashboards.

Contextual presentation makes clinical timelines, directories and operational information usable for people. It consumes established identity and security context while preserving the originating authority of what is shown; a user interface does not become an alternative persistence or policy boundary.</documentation>
