              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Contextual Information Presentation" id="id-dc26649d879b5c23813b59e7ada49e3d">
                <documentation>Present governed longitudinal clinical and operational information in its applicable human interaction context.

**Overview**

Present governed longitudinal clinical and operational information in its applicable human interaction context. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Present governed longitudinal clinical and operational information in its applicable human interaction context.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
