          <folder name="[CT2] Workflow &amp; Activity Coordination" id="id-db1a067f70274dd1a50a83a490b63560">
            <folder name="[CT3] Activity Routing Management" id="id-2a37be3e727345849123a088c171af37">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Activity Routing Management" id="id-96e9160ac5bc532faed556f17a714f99">
                <documentation>Manage responsibility and destination routing for activity crossing the Harmonia execution boundary, respecting the intended work and completion responsibility.

**Overview**

Manage responsibility and destination routing for activity crossing the Harmonia execution boundary, respecting the intended work and completion responsibility. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage responsibility and destination routing for activity crossing the Harmonia execution boundary, respecting the intended work and completion responsibility.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
