          <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="Shared Information &amp; Coordination Enablement" id="id-a5127b36f8a25c748c68426668173fcd">
            <documentation>Enable governed shared health-information use, exchange, stewardship, knowledge, collaboration, external work coordination, calendars, presentation and information design.

**Overview**

Enable governed shared health-information use, exchange, stewardship, knowledge, collaboration, external work coordination, calendars, presentation and information design.

**Intent**

Enable governed shared health-information use, exchange, stewardship, knowledge, collaboration, external work coordination, calendars, presentation and information design.

**Boundary**

Preservation, custody, discoverability and presentation do not confer originating fact authority. Clinical documentation administration and clinical-context use retain their own responsibilities.</documentation>
