              <folder name="Services" id="id-daaec63492484abaa44ac0b786ab29bc">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Service Offering Readiness Query" id="id-6faff100c7ba555aa7b35ea22d43829b">
                  <documentation>Expose the qualified readiness view of a defined offering and operating context to operational planning consumers.

**Overview**

The response identifies relevant evidence basis and insufficiency rather than an unconditional ready flag.

**Boundary**

A readiness answer grants no resource allocation or clinical go/no-go authority.</documentation>
