                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Coordinate Entity-Relative Input" id="id-71475841f2d356ed845244bf16548e78">
                  <documentation>Select interested behaviours and progress one entity-relative input with explicit participation and effect standing.

**Overview**

Moves an accepted input through the applicable stable behaviour sequence using fresh managed contexts.

**Boundary**

No concurrent intra-entity progression or implicit clinical authority is introduced.</documentation>
