              <folder name="Services" id="id-0d01455d19dc4122a8b8b480fe692914">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Entity Operational Input Submission" id="id-cc4944fb648457dcb1b5288da72cda01">
                  <documentation>Allow authorised domain coordinators to submit an entity-relative stimulus or requested operational effect.

**Overview**

Acceptance concerns the stated handoff contract; the caller observes completion/effect through separately qualified progression information.

**Boundary**

Input acceptance does not establish successful completion or authority over source clinical facts.</documentation>
