                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Establish Activity Effect Observation Basis" id="id-7146dde4fa7d5de8bf4a48d3638bd792">
                  <documentation>Associate the applicable handoff contract and authoritative observations with an indeterminate operational undertaking.

**Overview**

Changes an unqualified uncertainty concern into a time- and attempt-specific observation basis for reconciliation.

**Boundary**

Source observations retain their authority; this is an operational observation basis rather than an independent assurance assessment.</documentation>
