                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Reconcile Indeterminate Activity Effects" id="id-6243b2abcf395f3e9446777baee272c5">
                  <documentation>Inspect authoritative observations to establish, qualify or retain uncertainty about a previously indeterminate activity effect.

**Overview**

Moves an uncertainty concern to a justified disposition while preserving the possibility that the original attempt produced an effect.

**Boundary**

Missing evidence does not establish absence of effect and cannot automatically justify a repeat mutation.</documentation>
