                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Determine Reconciled Activity Continuation" id="id-74c46d7f30765d1684db081ebfa23a26">
                  <documentation>Establish the permitted operational continuation from reconciled effect standing and applicable authorisation.

**Overview**

Moves a reconciled undertaking to justified continuation, authorised retry or explicitly retained uncertainty.

**Boundary**

Does not confer clinical decision authority or infer absence of effects from silence; policy evaluation remains separately owned.</documentation>
