&quot;}],&quot;method&quot;:&quot;AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task&quot;},&quot;rationale&quot;:&quot;This Function participates in the explicitly ordered proposed reconciliation chain, retaining its capability responsibility.&quot;,&quot;sources&quot;:[],&quot;status&quot;:&quot;Proposed&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;proposal:function-determine-reconciled-activity-continuation&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;participating_function&quot;},&quot;source_index&quot;:499}]"/>
