md#assess-assurance-evidence) and [Adjudicate Assurance Assessment](../behaviours/health-service-assurance.md#adjudicate-assurance-assessment), all retaining Governed Assurance ownership.&quot;}],&quot;status&quot;:&quot;established&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;function:assess-assurance-evidence&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;participating_function&quot;},&quot;source_index&quot;:233},{&quot;disposition&quot;:&quot;metadata_and_finding&quot;,&quot;reason&quot;:&quot;Participation alone does not establish an ordered/whole-part process or realisation.&quot;,&quot;record_state&quot;:&quot;preserved historical assertion&quot;,&quot;snapshot_pointer&quot;:&quot;/relationships/234&quot;,&quot;source_assertion&quot;:{&quot;from&quot;:&quot;process:assurance-process-execution&quot;,&quot;sources&quot;:[{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;62-assurance-process-execution&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:373,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;processes&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;- **Participating Functions**: [Establish Assurance Context](../behaviours/health-service-assurance.md#establish-assurance-context), [Assess Assurance Evidence](../behaviours/health-service-assurance.md#assess-assurance-evidence) and [Adjudicate Assurance Assessment](../behaviours/health-service-assurance.md#adjudicate-assurance-assessment), all retaining Governed Assurance ownership.&quot;}],&quot;status&quot;:&quot;established&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;function:adjudicate-assurance-assessment&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;participating_function&quot;},&quot;source_index&quot;:234},{&quot;disposition&quot;:&quot;metadata_and_finding&quot;,&quot;reason&quot;:&quot;Use alone does not establish invocation, sequencing or native Serving.&quot;,&quot;record_state&quot;:&quot;preserved historical assertion&quot;,&quot;snapshot_pointer&quot;:&quot;/relationships/294&quot;,&quot;source_assertion&quot;:{&quot;from&quot;:&quot;service:request-service-assurance&quot;,&quot;sources&quot;:[{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;51-request-service-assurance&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:170,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;assurance&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;- **Process Relationship**: Requests [Assurance Process Execution](../processes/business-processes.md#assurance-process-execution) under an applicable established Assurance Definition. It does not require a new Assurance Process Design instance for each request.&quot;}],&quot;status&quot;:&quot;established&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;process:assurance-process-execution&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;uses_process&quot;},&quot;source_index&quot;:294}]"/>
