                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Qualify Information Authority Standing" id="id-1feb20e89c115281aed3c0bdc86623bb">
                  <documentation>Associate source and credibility qualifications with an information assertion under applicable governed semantics.

**Overview**

Moves an unqualified received assertion to explicitly attributed authority standing without equating persistence success to credibility.

**Boundary**

Does not adjudicate all competing claims or originate clinical truth.</documentation>
