                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Mandatory Audit Evidence Capture" id="id-94caf7d1a6c85f7a86c64db72c8cc84e">
                  <documentation>Allow governed-operation boundaries to require authoritative capture of significant activity evidence.

**Overview**

The client contract distinguishes confirmed capture from inability to capture, allowing required operations to fail closed.

**Boundary**

The exposed boundary does not permit callers to assign themselves audit platform authority.</documentation>
