              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Route Acute Critical Result Alert" id="id-5eafdfa570265a29b3b02ee8c4b006bd">
                <documentation>Immediately directs urgent lab/radiology alerts (e.g., critical troponin, intracranial bleed) to active acute attending clinicians.

