            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Authorised Research Information Export" id="id-c4599a96d4515815b0f9e3f0bea1cb3a">
              <documentation>Provide an approved research consumer with purpose-qualified existing health information under its release contract.

**Overview**

The service exposes the permitted release and its applicable use basis rather than unrestricted clinical repository access.

**Boundary**

No new research-governance mandate or universal release format is allocated.</documentation>
