            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Manage Bed Turnover Progression" id="id-74201cc998e2512aa13c3f0d391098ac">
              <documentation>Coordinates cleaning, disinfection, and preparation: Vacated → Cleaning Requested → Cleaning In-Progress → Inspected/Ready → Occupied.

Additional Feature responsibility: FEAT-HSO-13 — Bed Readiness Notification requires the existing turnover behaviour/exposure to notify bed allocation managers and clinical units when a cleaned bed is ready. Readiness notification remains distinct from availability query and from physical placement; no new lifecycle state or Service is introduced.</documentation>
