                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Verify Clinical Qualification for Work Dispatch" id="id-6933f43beb6a5e83ad5a87ba30539e9f">
                  <documentation>Validates that a practitioner possesses active clinical credentials and required competency certificates before dispatch of specialised work.

