            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Manage Discharge Coordination Progression" id="id-6c95803fb2b1558cac669cfeb342e240">
              <documentation>Synchronises multi-agency discharge readiness (illustrative preparation; publication, authorisation and confirmed exit are distinct): Discharge Planning Initiated → Medications Reconciled → Transport Booked → Discharge Summary Finalised → Physically Departed.</documentation>
