            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Coordinate ED Departmental Capacity" id="id-2eadf51e0bc055b0b8a4dc2ce970299c">
              <documentation>Understands and manages available, committed and utilised ED capacity in relation to care-place availability, demand, patient presence/progression, acuity and operational constraints; retains waiting room occupancy, resuscitation bay availability and time-to-triage metrics.

Capacity boundary: Existing departmental capacity responsibility is clarified, not duplicated. Care-place state contributes to service capacity; capacity coordination neither performs clinical triage nor establishes clinical acuity assertions.</documentation>
