          <folder name="[CT3] Mobile Worker Dispatch &amp; Safety Coordination" id="id-b07551c79d0248ceba5742a42ef28adc">
            <folder name="[Feature] Mobile Service Capacity Management" id="id-0910ccb424c649d8a55ff195af6c0232">
              <folder name="Functions" id="id-9157bdae72814860a47384a3c801cdb1">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Manage Mobile Service Capacity" id="id-82c4b2c578c85fbd8aac33420efc2b45">
                  <documentation>Understands and manages available, committed and utilised mobile-service capacity in relation to workforce availability, geography, time, workload and applicable service demand.

Responsibility boundary: Staff presence and externally established assignments/visit progression contribute to capacity; they do not alone express it. Capacity coordination does not determine clinical work, own the source workforce roster or allocate underlying clinical duties.</documentation>
