            <folder name="[Feature] Post-Clinic Order Coordination" id="id-fea4146a23594380b12b03396721a76d">
              <folder name="Functions" id="id-d31862520c974aa780d1bd52d437baac">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Capture Post-Clinic Follow-up Requirements" id="id-a5645ead0f4752ff9aad8f40b413743e">
                  <documentation>Captures follow-up booking and diagnostic-order requirements generated at clinic completion.

Derivation: FEAT-HSO-10 directly establishes this capture responsibility. The Clinic queue Process's consultation-concluded checkpoint describes orders placed, not Outpatient Operations' capture of follow-up requirements. Capture does not authorise clinical orders, own authoritative bookings or establish a new Service dependency.</documentation>
