            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Manage Theatre Case Progression" id="id-53ee867aea295460a3318a40bceb3ba2">
              <documentation>Coordinates surgical case milestones: Case Called → Patient in Anaesthetic Bay → Anaesthesia Commenced → Knife to Skin → Procedure Finished → In PACU/Recovery → Ward Handover Complete.

Additional Feature responsibility: FEAT-HSO-06 — Perioperative Resource Notification is realised by dispatching progression-triggered alerts to portering, sterilisation and recovery teams within this same case-progression behaviour/exposure. Milestone observation alone does not establish notification; no new Function or Service is created.</documentation>
