                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Assemble Ward Handover Context" id="id-52dfd140ab2f52fbb4d10aee0e015f32">
                  <documentation>Collates current ward patient lists, active medical concerns and pending tasks for nursing shift handover.

