              <folder name="Processes" id="id-2019d1c757364dd1869eb3c069815b05">
                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessProcess" name="Operational Work Progression Process" id="id-64bf723fe0985e75967cf435d0f49fe1">
                  <documentation>•
Owning Capability: Work Allocation &amp; Dispatch

•
Process Purpose: Governs the dispatch, assignment, execution, and completion of facility operational jobs (e.g., equipment moves, waste removal, linen supply).

•
State Progression Lifecycle: Work Requested → Queued in Dispatch → Assigned to Worker → Job Accepted → Work In-Progress → Work Completed / Aborted

•
Key State Dispositions:

•
Work Requested: Facility support task submitted by clinical unit.

•
Queued in Dispatch: Job prioritized in operational queue.

•
Assigned to Worker: Job allocated to specific staff member or team.

•
Job Accepted: Worker acknowledges dispatch on mobile device.

•
Work In-Progress: Task actively being executed.

•
Work Completed / Aborted: Job marked finished or formally cancelled with reason.

Operational work progression makes the path from a recognised support requirement to assigned and reported work explicit. Acknowledgement and activity progress help distinguish a dispatch from actual performance and expose impediments requiring operational attention. This responsibility remains bounded to authorised support work rather than ownership of the clinician's worklist.</documentation>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="process:operational-work-progression-process"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="HCM-PR-operational-work-progression-process"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / LaTeX Label" value="process:operational-work-progression-process"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Construct Type" value="process"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Architectural Status" value="Canonical"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Record State" value="current"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Placement Status" value="Established"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Structural ID Status" value="Proposed"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Structural Canonical ID" value="CT1-BEC-CARE-OPERATIONS-COORDINATION-ENABLEMENT.CT2-BEC-WORK-ALLOCATION-DISPATCH.PR-OPERATIONAL-WORK-PROGRESSION-PROCESS"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Historical ID Aliases" value="[&quot;CT1-BEC-CARE-OPERATIONS-COORDINATION-ENABLEMENT.CT2-BEC-OPERATIONAL-WORKFORCE-COORDINATION.CT3-BEC-WORK-ALLOCATION-DISPATCH.PR-OPERATIONAL-WORK-PROGRESSION-PROCESS&quot;]"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Name Status" value="Canonical"/>
