                  <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Record JSON" value="{&quot;ancestry_status&quot;:&quot;proposed&quot;,&quot;architectural_status&quot;:&quot;Canonical&quot;,&quot;baseline_description&quot;:{&quot;Function Overview&quot;:&quot;Criteria management maintains the reusable evaluative basis and its temporal standing. It permits an assessment to be understood against the criterion applicable at the relevant time, rather than today's unqualified version. Management of that basis does not inherently grant approval authority or permit alteration of the governing obligation.&quot;},&quot;baseline_placement&quot;:{&quot;canonical_id&quot;:null,&quot;owner_key&quot;:&quot;capability:assurance-criteria-management&quot;,&quot;parent_key&quot;:null,&quot;tier&quot;:null},&quot;baseline_unresolved&quot;:[&quot;ancestry&quot;,&quot;canonical_id&quot;,&quot;code_allocation&quot;,&quot;feature_association&quot;,&quot;contextual_view&quot;],&quot;baseline_version&quot;:&quot;0.1&quot;,&quot;canonical_id&quot;:&quot;CT1-BEC-INDEPENDENT-SERVICE-ASSURANCE-ENABLEMENT.CT2-BEC-ASSURANCE-SPECIFICATION-ENABLEMENT.CT3-BEC-ASSURANCE-CRITERIA-MANAGEMENT.FN-MANAGE-ASSURANCE-CRITERIA&quot;,&quot;canonical_name&quot;:&quot;Manage Assurance Criteria&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:null,&quot;governed_definition_latex&quot;:&quot;\n\\begin{itemize}\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Canonical Name}: \\texttt{\\seqsplit{Manage Assurance Criteria}}.\n\n\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Definition}: Establishes and manages reusable, governed and temporally identifiable assurance criteria through which governed subjects may be evaluated.\n\n\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Scope}: Criteria may express governance rule boundaries, quality constraints, performance expectations, compliance criteria, temporal criteria, evidence requirements or completeness expectations. These examples are not an exhaustive taxonomy. Criteria may have lifecycle, version and temporal applicability.\n\n\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Boundary}: Managing a criterion does not transfer authority for the governing requirement from which it may derive. Criteria may operationalise a requirement without silently altering, weakening, strengthening or replacing it; not every criterion must derive from formal Governance. Modelling/\\allowbreak{}managing criteria does not inherently confer approval authority. Detailed criterion lifecycle states and approval workflows remain unresolved.\n\n\n\n\\end{itemize}\n&quot;,&quot;id_aliases&quot;:[],&quot;key&quot;:&quot;function:manage-assurance-criteria&quot;,&quot;latex_label&quot;:&quot;function:manage-assurance-criteria&quot;,&quot;local_id&quot;:&quot;MANAGE-ASSURANCE-CRITERIA&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Manage Assurance Criteria&quot;,&quot;name_aliases&quot;:[],&quot;name_status&quot;:&quot;Canonical&quot;,&quot;owner_identifier&quot;:&quot;HCM-BEC-assurance-criteria-management&quot;,&quot;owner_key&quot;:&quot;capability:assurance-criteria-management&quot;,&quot;parent_identifier&quot;:null,&quot;parent_key&quot;:null,&quot;placement_status&quot;:&quot;Established&quot;,&quot;record_state&quot;:&quot;current&quot;,&quot;reference_id&quot;:&quot;HCM-FN-manage-assurance-criteria&quot;,&quot;responsibility_owner_key&quot;:&quot;capability:assurance-criteria-management&quot;,&quot;source_rad_documents&quot;:[&quot;docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/behaviours/health-service-assurance.md&quot;],&quot;sources&quot;:[{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;manage-assurance-criteria&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:84,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;assurance&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;#### Manage Assurance Criteria&quot;}],&quot;structural_id_status&quot;:&quot;Proposed&quot;,&quot;tier&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;function&quot;,&quot;unresolved&quot;:[&quot;feature_association&quot;,&quot;contextual_view&quot;],&quot;views&quot;:[]}"/>
