              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Governed Reference Dataset Content Query" id="id-8b2a95285ad65f61bae6d379425bf9e4">
                <documentation>Provide authorised consumers with approved content at an identified revision and applicability basis.

**Overview**

Consumers can resolve the membership or mapping content they actually used without treating build-time model definitions as runtime data.

**Boundary**

Does not grant unrestricted dataset mutation or external terminology authority.</documentation>
