            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Retrieve Health Information" id="id-b3bf36bb09e9570e8d8ccca1f170a022">
              <documentation>Fetches discrete clinical observations and original attachments.

Feature association not established: FEAT-ISE-09 — Access-Controlled Information Filtering requires access-controlled disclosure/filtering; retrieval of discrete information alone does not materially realise that responsibility. No replacement Feature is assigned.

Retrieval obtains discrete clinical information or attachments under the owning access responsibility. It is distinct from applying the access-qualified filtering required by FEAT-ISE-09. A shared owner and related data do not justify making that unresolved realisation association authoritative.</documentation>
