            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Propagate Security Context" id="id-fad39b654ac4567798905571648a43d9">
              <documentation>Generates and binds canonical, immutable security contexts to all intra-platform transactions.

Exposure qualification: Validation is the declared Service behaviour. Its juxtaposition with Propagate Security Context does not establish a one-to-one Function/Service relationship; the precise internal mapping remains unestablished.

Propagation preserves attributable operational security context across managed transactions. It provides continuity of context rather than independently deciding permission for every downstream action. The nearby validation Service has its own declared exposure; juxtaposition does not establish an exact one-to-one implementation relationship.</documentation>
