            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Security Context Validation Service" id="id-7ec30e1d7cf4575283579d0a1ccf0523">
              <documentation>Verifies transaction security credentials.

Exposure qualification: Validation is the declared Service behaviour. Its juxtaposition with Propagate Security Context does not establish a one-to-one Function/Service relationship; the precise internal mapping remains unestablished.

This Service lets a client obtain validation of transaction security credentials. The exposure is established even though its precise internal Function mapping is not. Validation must not be rewritten as context propagation merely to manufacture a symmetrical Function-to-Service pair.</documentation>
