              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Associated Binary Content Retrieval" id="id-4a95ba1792425d52b3efcface99d5162">
                <documentation>Allow information-consuming capabilities to request resolution and retrieval of associated content.

**Overview**

The client contract returns authorised content or explicit incomplete/unavailable standing while retaining custody attribution.

**Boundary**

The client acquires neither physical repository access nor originating clinical authority.</documentation>
