                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Resolve Associated Binary Content" id="id-f58d2399c9b85386a82d7c300c228f58">
                  <documentation>Resolve logical content associations to an authorised, custody-qualified retrieval basis.

**Overview**

Changes an unresolved content request into an identified retrieval basis or an explicit inability to resolve it.

**Boundary**

Does not assert payload existence, copy all content or establish clinical meaning.</documentation>
