          <documentation>**Description**: Information describing another party's authority to represent, consent for, make decisions for, or otherwise act on behalf of an individual.</documentation>
        </element>
        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="[Topic] Contact" id="id-5e6cbbe10a2c4a0b8e1d50fedd53c0c2" profiles="id-5a89cc5b58a84b449fad554acd6b9c5b">
          <documentation>**Description**: Information describing how an individual may be contacted or communicated with, including applicable addresses and communication channels.</documentation>
