        <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="[Topic] Individual" id="id-bd2c303e65434409b69777c403116005" profiles="id-5a89cc5b58a84b449fad554acd6b9c5b">
          <documentation>**Description**: Information concerning an individual, their identity, identifiers, demographic characteristics, relationships, and their contextual participation as a subject of healthcare.</documentation>
