        <element xsi:type="archimate:Principle" name="Separation of Transport from Business Logic" id="id-3c030f45802c59fc9991284d29cb5808">
          <documentation>The messaging framework (Petasos) treats all payloads as opaque byte arrays. Transport routes are unaware of clinical schemas. Transformation logic is strictly isolated in modular task activities (Erga).</documentation>
