        <element xsi:type="archimate:Requirement" name="INT-001 — Standards-Based Healthcare Interoperability" id="id-56665761dff556fe88255ab125e7fe91">
          <documentation>Harmonia shall support healthcare interoperability through standards-based interfaces including HL7 v2 and HL7 FHIR R5, while permitting governed adapters for proprietary source-system interfaces where required.</documentation>
