\chapter{Human-reviewed BEC reconciliation}\label{model:bec-review}
The explicit human-reviewed candidate governs this bounded reconciliation. It does not accept this publication into RADS. AX-14 preserves semantic distinctions; AX-17 retains unadjudicated responsibility placement; AX-18 prevents information administration from conferring authority over clinical or enterprise activity. BC and EC architecture have not been independently redesigned.

