Framework oversight alone is too narrow; programme authority and exact boundary require review.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Review Confidence}
Low; applies to the proposal, not to preserved canonical meaning.
\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Preserved v0.1 Review Matters}

DN-BC-027 establishes spelling of this named working concern, not a precise tier/\allowbreak{}parent or definition.


