\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Feature Overview}

Governed correction applies externally authoritative identity updates and their consequences to Harmonia-managed associations. Administrative review concerns the legitimate application of the source outcome; it does not grant Harmonia an EMPI merge engine or authority to select a golden person record.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Definition / governed semantic detail}

Apply administrative identity updates, linked-record corrections, and split/\allowbreak{}merge notifications propagated from authoritative sources.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Prior Candidate Derivation}
\hyperref[model:reconciliation]{v0.3 reconciliation}: \texttt{\seqsplit{BEC-44123E71}} (line 2698). Working locators are not identity aliases.
