Administer identifying, descriptive, structural, location, contact, registered/\allowbreak{}legal and recognised endpoint information needed to represent and interact with a healthcare organisation.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Boundary}

Maintains verified legal and operational identity information without corporate management authority.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Proposed Placement Rationale}

