\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Pre-review semantics — historical}

Exact prior assertions are retained as reconciliation evidence, rather than descriptions of the current reviewed capability.


\textbf{Previous definition:} Authoritative identification and profiling of legal and operational healthcare entities.


\textbf{Previous overview:} An identifiable legal or operational healthcare organisation needs verified identifiers, a profile and published standing. This description anchors service and affiliation relationships without managing the organisation itself.


\textbf{Previous intent:} Give service and affiliation references a verified organisational identity anchor.


