\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Capability Overview}

Administer the stable description, characteristics and physical location of a bed, bay, chair or other care-place.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Definition — Reviewed candidate}

Administer the stable description, characteristics and physical location of a bed, bay, chair or other care-place.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Boundary}

Describes a place and its capabilities; operational bed state and readiness remain separately managed.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Proposed Placement Rationale}

Responsibility-preserving placement under the human-reviewed BEC hierarchy; the structural assertion remains Proposed.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Derivation Provenance}
Inferred from bounded responsibilities and their semantic decomposition. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:e01893359d483acf]{business-enabling-capabilities.md:185}; \hyperref[evidence:be61392fefb4bb10]{information-responsibility.md:10}
\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Reviewed reconciliation provenance}
Reconciliation against the explicit human-reviewed BEC candidate hierarchy. Bounded semantic reconciliation; no unconstrained synthesis \hyperref[evidence:405e9742dcba8b45]{reviewed-bec-hierarchy.json:2}
\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Pre-review semantics — historical}

Exact prior assertions are retained as reconciliation evidence, rather than descriptions of the current reviewed capability.


\textbf{Previous definition:} Modeling the atomic care delivery places (beds, bays, treatment chairs, surgical tables).


\textbf{Previous overview:} A particular bed, bay, treatment chair or procedural place has stable physical characteristics relevant to care. Those descriptive capabilities remain separate from occupancy, cleaning state and suitability for a current patient.


\textbf{Previous intent:} Describe the stable characteristics that distinguish one care place from another.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Prior Candidate Derivation}
\hyperref[model:reconciliation]{v0.3 reconciliation}: \texttt{\seqsplit{BEC-0C8D2717}} (line 3791). Working locators are not identity aliases.
