\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Capability Overview}

Administer device type, instance, identifying and descriptive information needed to recognise clinical equipment and its stated capabilities.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Definition — Reviewed candidate}

Administer device type, instance, identifying and descriptive information needed to recognise clinical equipment and its stated capabilities.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Boundary}

Describes device types and capabilities without taking regulatory approval or clinical-use authority.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Proposed Placement Rationale}

Responsibility-preserving placement under the human-reviewed BEC hierarchy; the structural assertion remains Proposed.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Derivation Provenance}
Inferred from bounded responsibilities and their semantic decomposition. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:e01893359d483acf]{business-enabling-capabilities.md:218}; \hyperref[evidence:be61392fefb4bb10]{information-responsibility.md:10}
\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Reviewed reconciliation provenance}
Reconciliation against the explicit human-reviewed BEC candidate hierarchy. Bounded semantic reconciliation; no unconstrained synthesis \hyperref[evidence:405e9742dcba8b45]{reviewed-bec-hierarchy.json:2}
\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Pre-review semantics — historical}

Exact prior assertions are retained as reconciliation evidence, rather than descriptions of the current reviewed capability.


\textbf{Previous definition:} Specifying medical equipment types, models, and regulatory classifications.


\textbf{Previous overview:} A device type has a model, regulatory description and stated capabilities used to interpret equipment context. This type-level responsibility differs from identifying the actual physical instance that produced information.


\textbf{Previous intent:} Make the stated type and capability of a device understandable before its instance is used as an information source.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Consolidated / decomposed predecessors}
\nameref{cap:bec-device-definition} (p.\,\pageref{cap:bec-device-definition}); \nameref{cap:bec-device-instance} (p.\,\pageref{cap:bec-device-instance})
