\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Feature Overview}

Plan ingestion/\allowbreak{}distribution is complemented by the ability to distinguish the applicable goal and plan context as a shared plan progresses.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Definition — Proposed}

Represent externally agreed care goals, participants and plan changes with their effective standing.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Boundary}

Representing a goal does not choose treatment, determine clinical completion or grant plan approval authority.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Proposed Placement Rationale}

Meaningful reviewed CT3 framing selected for the existing Feature semantics; established responsibility provenance is preserved.


