\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Feature Overview}

Mobile availability cannot be interpreted as a simple on-duty count because distance, assignments and suitable skills affect deliverability.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Definition — Proposed}

Represent mobile service capacity with travel, coverage, work commitment and availability context.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Boundary}

Local responsibility retains its capacity meaning; Service Capacity Management consumes it without acquiring ownership or imposing one common capacity model.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Proposed Placement Rationale}

Meaningful reviewed CT3 framing selected for the existing Feature semantics; established responsibility provenance is preserved.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Derivation Provenance}
Inferred from capability-specific behaviour, v0.3 inspection and current architectural evidence. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:be61392fefb4bb10]{information-responsibility.md:34}
