\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Definition / governed semantic detail}

Exchanges externally established work/\allowbreak{}assignment, dispatch and operational progression/\allowbreak{}status information, with applicable worker/\allowbreak{}context information, between mobile work-management mechanisms and Harmonia operational coordination.


\emph{Derivation and boundary}: The human adjudication of \texttt{\seqsplit{FEAT-HSO-16}} establishes integration with mobile work/\allowbreak{}task management. This responsibility is absent from presence observation and visit-specific milestone ingestion. It does not determine, allocate or manage the underlying clinical work, clinical handover or EMR worklists. Work Allocation \&amp; Dispatch retains non-clinical operational Work Order responsibility.


