\cataloguefield{subsection}{Definition — Reviewed candidate}

Coordinate tasks entering or leaving the Harmonia execution boundary and work undertaken by other systems, with responsibility/\allowbreak{}destination routing, external status/\allowbreak{}traceability and governance of the completion bridge.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Intent}

Coordinate tasks entering or leaving the Harmonia execution boundary and work undertaken by other systems, with responsibility/\allowbreak{}destination routing, external status/\allowbreak{}traceability and governance of the completion bridge.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Boundary}

External means outside Harmonia execution, potentially inside the same health organisation. Work coordination includes completion responsibilities and traceability; it is not generic interoperability or message routing.


