Inferred from bounded responsibilities and their semantic decomposition. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:a4c0900c47c945d9]{business-capabilities.md:611}; \hyperref[evidence:be61392fefb4bb10]{information-responsibility.md:10}
