\chapter{Contextual views and prior descriptions}\label{model:contexts}
These views provide navigation across the proposed hierarchy. Membership remains different from decomposition. In entity information, distinct named descriptions become Proposed CT3s. Elsewhere the Canonical responsibility itself usually provides CT3 framing, so an old description is not mechanically made another tier.

