HUMAN ADJUDICATION REQUIRED: The Canonical Function includes pathology bio-specimens, blood products and surgical trays. Surgical-tray/\allowbreak{}materiel movement is excluded from reviewed Clinical Logistics Coordination; a specimen/\allowbreak{}materiel semantic split requires human judgement.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Definition / governed semantic detail}

Tracks the physical transit of pathology bio-specimens, blood products, and surgical trays: \emph{Collected} → \emph{Courier Picked Up} → \emph{In-Transit} → \emph{Laboratory Ingress Received}.


