\cataloguefield{subsection}{Capability Overview}

Emergency presentation, inpatient rounds and outreach visits need different contextual assemblies of the same underlying information. This frame retains those established setting-specific responsibilities as compositions rather than duplicate records or clinical execution authorities.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Definition — Proposed}

Compose governed information and coordination behaviour for materially different care settings, continuity arrangements and specialist clinical purposes.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Intent}

Give a care participant the appropriate information context for the particular integration purpose without duplicating general information responsibilities.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Boundary}

Setting, care mode and specialty are overlapping contextual dimensions. These children are integration responsibilities, not a mutually exclusive taxonomy of patients or clinical care.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Derivation Provenance}
Inferred from bounded responsibilities and their semantic decomposition. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:4bac85accd34ce0b]{business-architecture-metamodel.md:49}; \hyperref[evidence:be61392fefb4bb10]{information-responsibility.md:10}; \hyperref[evidence:27549d51551beae6]{architectural-axioms.md:668}
\cataloguefield{subsection}{Reviewed successors}
\nameref{cap:bec-reviewed-clinical-service-dependency-management} (p.\,\pageref{cap:bec-reviewed-clinical-service-dependency-management}); \nameref{cap:bec-patient-clinical-record} (p.\,\pageref{cap:bec-patient-clinical-record}); \nameref{cap:bec-episode-encounter-administration} (p.\,\pageref{cap:bec-episode-encounter-administration}); \nameref{cap:bec-emergency-department-operations} (p.\,\pageref{cap:bec-emergency-department-operations}); \nameref{cap:bec-ward-operations} (p.\,\pageref{cap:bec-ward-operations}); \nameref{cap:bec-diagnostic-administration} (p.\,\pageref{cap:bec-diagnostic-administration}); \nameref{cap:bec-medication-administration} (p.\,\pageref{cap:bec-medication-administration}); \nameref{cap:bec-client-centred-administration} (p.\,\pageref{cap:bec-client-centred-administration}); \nameref{cap:bec-care-plan-administration} (p.\,\pageref{cap:bec-care-plan-administration})
