\cataloguefield{subsection}{Capability Overview}

Effective affiliations explain which practitioner or team participates with which organisation. These relationships support collaboration and routing while each participating identity keeps its own responsibility owner.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Definition — Proposed}

Managing organizational affiliations and multidisciplinary team relationships.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Intent}

Preserve which affiliations apply when interpreting provider participation.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Boundary}

Affiliation records do not transfer the participating organisations or practitioner identities to this capability.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Derivation Provenance}
Inferred from bounded responsibilities and their semantic decomposition. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:e01893359d483acf]{business-enabling-capabilities.md:150}; \hyperref[evidence:be61392fefb4bb10]{information-responsibility.md:10}
