The established reusable responsibility is a constituent ability of Governed Information Operations; its canonical scope and exclusions remain unchanged.\\\hline
\nameref{cap:ec-trust-accountability-assurance} (p.\,\pageref{cap:ec-trust-accountability-assurance}) &amp; \nameref{cap:ec-06} (p.\,\pageref{cap:ec-06}) &amp; Proposed

The established reusable responsibility is a constituent ability of Trust, Accountability \&amp; Assurance; its canonical scope and exclusions remain unchanged.\\\hline
\nameref{cap:ec-trust-accountability-assurance} (p.\,\pageref{cap:ec-trust-accountability-assurance}) &amp; \nameref{cap:ec-07} (p.\,\pageref{cap:ec-07}) &amp; Proposed

The established reusable responsibility is a constituent ability of Trust, Accountability \&amp; Assurance; its canonical scope and exclusions remain unchanged.\\\hline
