The established reusable responsibility is a constituent ability of Coordinated Activity \&amp; Interaction; its canonical scope and exclusions remain unchanged.\\\hline
\nameref{cap:ec-coordinated-activity-interaction} (p.\,\pageref{cap:ec-coordinated-activity-interaction}) &amp; \nameref{cap:ec-09} (p.\,\pageref{cap:ec-09}) &amp; Proposed

The established reusable responsibility is a constituent ability of Coordinated Activity \&amp; Interaction; its canonical scope and exclusions remain unchanged.\\\hline
